<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">Marka</book>
  <para style="h">Marka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marka</para>
  <para style="mt">Marka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian Fapa Jesuh Khrih ih Thuthang ṭha cu hiti in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thokah profet Isaiah in: “Pathian in ‘Na hmaiah ka palai ka thlah ding; Na hrangih lamzin sialtu dingah,’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi pakhat cu ramṭhingah a au ih, ‘Bawipa ih hrangah lamzin sial uh, A fehnak ding lamzin kha dingter uh,’ a ti,” tiah a ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Johan cu ramṭhing ihsin a ra ih baptisma a pek hai ih thu tla a sim phah vivo. Mipi pawl kha, “Nan sualnak sir uhla baptisma lak uh. Cuticun Pathian in nan sualnak a lo ngaithiam ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judea peng le Jerusalem khawpi ihsin mi tampi Johan ih thusimmi ngai dingah an ra. An sualnak an phuang ih Jordan tiva ah baptisma a pek hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Johan cu kalauk hmulih tahmi hnipuan a hruk ih a taai ah savun taikhap a khap. A rawl eimi cu kharbok le hramlak khuaitizu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mipi hnenah, “Ka dungih a ra dingmi pa cu keimah hnakin a nasa sawn a si. Kun tahrat in a kedam hri phoih saktu ding hmanah kei cu ka tlak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei cun tidai in baptisma ka lo pek. Asinain anih cun Thlarau Thianghlim in baptisma a lo pek hai ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih hnu rei loteah Galilee peng Nazareth khua ihsin Jesuh cu a ra ih Jordan tiva ah Johan in baptisma a rak pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesuh cu ti sung ihsin a hung suah vete in van a ong aw ih Thlarau cu thuro bangin a parih a rung fut kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Van ihsin aw pakhat a rung thang ih, “Nangmah cu ka duhdawtmi ka Fapa na si. Na parah ka lung a kim ngaingai,” tiah a run ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmakhatteah Jesuh cu ramṭhing ah Thlarau in a fehter ih
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />cutawkah ni sawmli a um ih Satan in a hniksak. Ramsa pawl thawn an um. Asinain vancungmi pawl in an rung tuamhlawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Johan kha thawngih an thlak hnuah Jesuh cu Galilee ah a feh ih Pathian ih Thuthang ṭha a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tikcu a kim zo ih Pathian Uknak a nai zo. Nan sualnak pawl sir uhla Thuthang ṭha cu zum uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesuh cu Galilee Tili kapih a feh laiah ngakaitu pahnih Simon le a nau Andru kha sur in nga an kaih rero laifang a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “I thlun uhla milai kaitu ah ka lo tuah ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmakhatteah an sur an taan ih amah cu an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hla deuh a va feh ih Zebedi ih fapa Jeim le Johan te unau hnih a hmu. Anmah cu an lawng sungah an um ih an sur an tholh rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh in a hmuh vete in an pahnih in a ko. Cuticun an pa Zebedi le an hlawhfa pawl cu lawng sungah cun an taan ih Jesuh cu an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Kapernaum khua ah an ra ih a thaisun Sabbath ni ah Jesuh cu pumkhawmnak inn Sinakok ah a feh ih thu a zirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thuzirh daan a theitu pawl cu an mang a bang ngaingai, ziangahtile Daanthiam pawl vek a si lo, anih cun thunei zetin a zirh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuih caanah khawsia in a polhmi mipa pakhat cu Sinakok ahcun a ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nazareth mi Jesuh, ziangso kannih in hai? Kanmah siatsuah dingah maw na rat? Zo na si ti ka lo thei: Pathian ih thlahmi Mi Thianghlim na si,” tiah a au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesuh in khawsia cu, “Daite in um aw! Kha pa sung in suak aw!” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khawsia in cupa cu nasa zetin a thin ih ring zetin a auter hnuah a suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mipi cu an mang a bang ngaingai ih pakhat le pakhat, “Ziangvek thu so a si? Zirhnak thar phun khat maw a si? Hi pa hi khawsia parah thu a nei ih ‘Suak uh!’ a tile an suak fawn,” tiah an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cuticun Jesuh thuhla cu Galilee peng khuazakip ah zamrang zetin a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthlun pawl cu Jeim le Johan tel in, sinakok ihsin an feh ih Simon le Andru inn lam pan in an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Simon ih pizon kha khurhnat in a na ih a tho thei lo; Jesuh a thlen vete in a nat thuhla cu an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mina hnenah cun a feh ih a kut a kai ih a thawhter. A khurhnat cu a reh lohli ih anmah a tuamhlawm thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ni a tlak ih zanlam a si tikah mipi in mina hmuahhmuah le khawsia ih polhmi pawl kha Jesuh hnenah an rat pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuih khua ih mi hmuahhmuah cu cuih inn hmai ahcun an ra tong khawm aw ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in an natnak phunphun kha a damter ih an sungih khawsia pawl tla a dawisuak ṭheh. Khawsia pawl cu kam khatte hman a ṭongter lo; ziangahtile zo a si ti kha an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A thaizing, zingthlapit ni suah hlanah, Jesuh cu a tho ih inn ihsin a suak. Hnarpawn ah a suak ih mi um lonak ah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Asinain Simon le a rualpi pawl cu amah hawl ah an feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />an va hmuh tikah a hnenah, “Mi hmuahhmuah in an lo hawl,” tiah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh in, “Hi kiangkap khua pawl khalah kan feh vivo ding, an hnenah thu ka sim ve ding, ziangahtile cucu ka rat hnawhsanmi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Curuangah Galilee peng pumpuluk tlawng in sinakok ah thu a sim vivo ih khawsia pawl a dawi suak vivo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Phaarnat in a na mipa pakhat cu Jesuh hnenah a ra ih a khuk bilh in, “Na duh a si ahcun i thiangter thei ko,” tiah bomnak a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesuh cun a zaangfah ngaingai ih a kut in a hei dawh hnuah a tham ih, “Ka lo thiangter duh zet a si, thiang thlang aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hmakhatteah a phaarnat cu a dam ih a thiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in cupa cu a fehter ih, fektein thu a tiam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Ngai aw! Hi thu hi zohman na sim lo pei. Puithiam hnenah va feh vurvo awla rak lo zohseh; cule mi hmuahhmuah in a dam a si ti an lo theihnak dingah Moses thupekmi vekih thawinak va pe aw,” tiah fektein thu a tiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Asinain cupa cu a feh ih a damnak thu cu hmunkip ah a than vivo. Cuih thu a rel tamtuk ruangah Jesuh cu khawsungah mi hmuhhngan in a feh thei nawn lo. Hnarpawn fianhrial sawnah amah lawng a um ih cutawkah hmunkip ihsin mi in an ra pan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni malte a rei hnuah Jesuh cu Kapernaum khua a ra thleng sal ih inn ah a um ti thu kha a thang ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi tamtuk an rat ruangah inn sung cu a lawngnak pakhat hman a um lo; sangka kiang a leng tiangin an khat ṭheh. An hnenah Jesuh in thu a sim;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />cuti ih a sim laifangah mi pali in mizengpa pakhat Jesuh hnenah an rak zawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Milai an tam tuk ruangah Jesuh hnenah cun an thlenpi thei lo. Curuangah Jesuh umnak zawn diphun kha an bauh ih mizengpa cu a ihphah parah it in an vun thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zumnak an neih zia kha Jesuh in a hmuh tikah mizengpa hnenah cun, “Ka fapa, na sualnak cu ngaithiam a si zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutawkih a to vemi Daanthiam hrekkhat pawl in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ziangtin so hi vekin a ṭong ngam? Pathian thangsiat a sisi. Pathian siar lo zoso mi sualnak a thlah thei?” tiah an thinlung tein an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An thinlung cu Jesuh in hmakhatte ah a thei ih an hnenah, “Ziangah so hi bangtuk in nan ruat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi mizengpa hnenah hin ‘Na sualnak cu ngaithiam a si zo,’ ti maw, ‘Tho awla na ihphah lak awla va feh aw,’ tiso a ol sawn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Milai Fapa in leilung parah mi ih sual ngaithiam theinak a nei a si, ti hi nan hnenah ka langter duh a si,” tiah a ti. Curuangah mizengpa hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tho aw; na ihphah la awla na inn ah va tin aw, ka lo ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An zatein an zoh ih cu laifangah mizengpa cu a tho; a ihphah a lak ih zamrang zetin a feh. An zatein an mang a bang tuk lawmmam ih “Hi bangtuk cu kan hmu dah lo,” an ti ih Pathian an thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesuh cu Galilee Tili kapah a va feh sal. Mi tampi a hnenah an ra ih thu a zirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A feh phahah siahkhongtu, Alfias ih fapa Levi a zungkhaan sungih a to kha a hmu. Jesuh in, “I thlun aw,” a ti. Levi cu a tho ih a thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh cu Levi inn ah rawl a ei. Siahkhong le misual tiih hnonmi tampi in Jesuh cu an thlun ih cu pawl ṭhenkhat cu Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl thawn rawl an ei tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Farasi mi Daanthiam hrekkhat pawl in Jesuh cu hi bangtuk hnonmi misual le siahkhong pawl thawn rawl a ei kha an hmuh tikah a dungthluntu pawl kha, “Ziangah so hi bangtuk mi pawl thawn rawl a ei?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih thu cu Jesuh in a thei ih, “Mi harhdam pawl in sibawi an hai lo; a na mi lawng in an hai a si. Miding pawl ko dingah ka ra lo, misual pawl ko dingah ka ra a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Voikhat ah baptisma petu Johan thluntu pawl le Farasi mi pawl rawl an ul. Mi ṭhenkhat pawl Jesuh hnenah an ra ih, “Ziangah so baptisma petu Johan dungthluntu pawl le Farasi thluntu pawl cu rawl an ul naón nang a lo thluntu pawl cu rawl an ulh lo?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Mopuai ih sawmmi pawl khi rawl an ul tiin nan ruat maw? An ul lo! Mopa an hnenih a um sungah cun rawl cu an ul lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an hnen ihsin mopa lak hlo a si ni a thleng ding ih cutikah rawl cu an ul ve leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Angki hlun belhnak ah zohman in puan tharte an hmang dah lo; ziangahtile belhnak puan thar cu a com ding ih hnipuan hlun sawn kha a tlekter ding ih a ong ciami kha a kau sinsin ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun sabitti thar kha savun thawl hlun sungah an than dah lo, ziangahtile sabitti thar in savun thawl hlun cu a kuaiter ding ih sabit le a thawl cu an cemral ding. Curuangah sabitti thar cu savun thawl thar sungah than sawn ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh cu Sabbath ni ah sangvut lo sungin a feh. Amah thawn hmun khatah a dungthluntu pawl tla an feh ve ih sangvut vui kha an zuut phah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Farasi pawl in Jesuh cu, “Zohhnik, na dungthlun pawl Sabbath ni ah hi bangtuk thil an tuah hi kan Daan ih duh lomi a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesuh in, “David in ei ding zianghman a neih lo tikah ziang a tuah ti cu nan siar dah lo maw si? Amah le a rualpi pawl an ril a rawng zet ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathian inn sungah lut tahratin Pathian hnenih hlanmi sang kha a ei. Culai ih Puithiam sang cu Abiathar a si. Kan Daan sung vek a si ahcun cuih sang cu puithiam lawngih eithiang a si. Asinain David in a ei ih cuih tlunah a rualpi pawl tla a pek,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in, “Sabbath cu minung hrangih tuahmi a si; minung hi Sabbath hrangih tuahmi a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah Milai Fapa cu Sabbath tlun khalah Bawi a si,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu sinakok ah a va feh sal ih cutawkah kut zengpa pakhat a rak um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesuh kha sualpuh a duhtu pawl tla an rak um ih curuangah Sabbath ni ah a damter ding maw damter lo ding tiah ṭhatein an zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh in cupa cu, “Hmailam ah hin ra suak hnik,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule mipi cu, “Kan Daan in Sabbath ni ah ziang tuah ding so in on? Mi bawm ding maw harsatnak pek ding so? Mi nunnak runsuah ding maw siatsuah ding so?” tiah a sut. Asinain annih cu kam khat hman an ṭong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesuh cun a thinheng in a zoh vivo hai ih an thinlung a ruh zia kha a hmuh tikah a riah a sia zet fawn. Cule mi pa cu, “Na baan hawi aw,” a ti. A baan cu a hawi ih a dam ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah Farasi mi pawl cu sinakok ihsin an suak ih Herod ih milai pawl thawn Jesuh thah theinak dingah thu an ruatkhawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Galilee Tili ah an va feh; miburpi in Jesuh cu an thlun. Anmah tla cu Galilee peng, Judea peng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem khua, Idumea peng, Jordan tiva ihsin nisuahnak lam ram, Tai-ar le Sidon kiangkap ram pawl tiang in a rami an si. Jesuh ih thil tuahmi pawl an theih ruangih a rami an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Milai an tamtuk lawmmam ih in ciil ciamco pang ding ti a phan ruangah dungthluntu pawl kha lawng pakhat timtuah cia in a retter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tampi a damter ih mina hmuahhmuah in an tham ngah theinak dingah an nor ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun khawsia polhmi pawl in an hmuh tikah a hmaiah an bok ih, “Nangmah cu Pathian Fapa na si,” tiah an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesuh in cuih khawsia polhmi pawl cu amah kha zo a si ti an rel lonak dingah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu tlangpar ah a hung kai ih a hnenah a mi duhmi pawl a ko. A hnenah cun an ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />minung hleihnih a hril ih ‘Tirhthlah pawl,’ tiah a ko. “Ka hnenih um dingah ka lo hril. Cule thusim dingah ka lo thlah ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />khawsia dawihlo theinak thu tla nan nei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hleihnih a hrilmi pawl cu hihi an si. Simon (Piter tiih hmin a pekmi),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zebedi ih fapa Jeim le a nau pa Johan (Jesuh in Boanerges tiah hmin a pek hai, a tican cu ‘Khawri Fa,’ tinak a si),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Andru, Filip, Bartholomeo, Matthai, Thomas, Alfias ih fapa Jeim, Thaddaeus, Phunṭan Simon, le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesuh a zuartu Judas Iskariot tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu inn ah a tlung. A hmaisa vek thotho in mi tam ngaingai an ra ih Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu rawl ei caan hman an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuih thu cu a sungte pawl in an theih tikah, “Jesuh cu a aa zo,” tiah mi in an ti fawn ruangah amah kilkhawi dingin an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem ihsin a rami Daanthiam hrekkhat pawl in Jesuh cu “Beelzebul in a kai zo a si. Khawsia uktu bawi ih huham in khawsia pawl a dawi thei a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh cun a ko hai ih an hnenah tahṭhimnak thawn thu a sim. “Ziangtin so Satan in Satan lala cu a dawi thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ram pakhatkhat cu ṭhen tampi ah a ṭhen aw ih anmah le anmah an do awk ahcun cuih ram cu an ṭekdarh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Innsang pakhat sungah pakhat le pakhat an to aw ih an thawi awk a si ahcun cuih innsang cu an ṭeekdarh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cubangtuk in Satan in Satan lala a dawisuak a si ahcun an ṭhenṭhek awk ruangah an ram cu rei a awh lo ding ih a cemral ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Micak pa cu amah an ṭem hmaisa lo ahcun zohman in a inn bauh tahratin a thilri an lak sak thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Thungaite in ka lo sim: minung hi ziangvek in an sual ih ṭong siava tiang an ṭong hmanah ngaihthiam an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Thlarau Thianghlim a thangsiattu cu ngaidam a si lo ding, ziangahtile kumkhua daih sualnak a tuah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesuh kha “Khawsia a sungah a lut,” tiah an ti ruangah Jesuh in hiti ih a ṭongnak hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule Jesuh ih nu le a naule pawl an ra. Inn lengah an ding ih inn sungah mi an vun tirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kiangah mi tampi an rak to ih annih in, “Zohhnik, na nu le na naupa pawl le na farnu pawl leeng ah an um, nangmah an lo poi,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Zoso ka nu cu a si? Ka naule tla cu zoso an si?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A kiangkapih a totu mipi pawl khi zoh phah in, “Hinah ka nu le ka naule tla cu an um ko a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zokhal sisehla Pathian duhnak a tuahtu hmuahhmuah cu ka unau, ka farnu le ka nu an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh in Galilee Tilikap ah thu a zirh sal. A kiangih a ra khawmmi minung pawl cu an tam tuk lawmmam ruangah lawng sungah a lut ih a to. Long cu tipar hlatnawn ah a um ih misenpi pawl cu tili kap tidai ri tiangin an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tahṭhimnak hmangin thu tampi a zirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh cun, “Ngaihnik uh: Voikhat ah mipa pakhat a um ih thlaici vorh dingin lo ah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lo sungih thlaici a vorh tikah a hrekkhat cu lamzin tluanah an tla ih vate in an ra sar thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hrekkhat cu leilung malnak lungsedaap lakah an tla. Leilung a sah lo ruangah thlaici cu hmakhatte ah an kho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain ni a hung sa ih thlaikho a ṭo pekte pawl cu a hun sat. An hram a thuk lo ruangah thlaikho cu an caar cing ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hrekkhat cu hlingbur lakah an tla; hlingkung pawl cu an ṭhang ih thlaikho cu an zaap ih vuirah nei thei loin an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain thlaici hrekkhat cu leilung ṭhatnak ah an tla, ṭhatein an kho ih an ṭhang ih vui an nei. A hrek cu a let sawmthum, a hrek cu a let sawmruk, a hrek cu a let zakhat tiangin thlai thar an suak,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A netnak ah, “Theihnak hna a neitu cun thei uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesuh cu amah lawng a um tikah a thusimmi a rak theitu hrekkhat pawl le dungthluntu hleihnih pawl a hnenah an ra ih a tahṭhimnak pawl simfiang dingah an ra dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Pathian Uknak thuthup cu nan hnenah pek a si zo. Sikhalsehla lenglamih a ummi pawl cu tahṭhimnak lawng in sim an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />curuangah, ‘An zoh rero ding naón an hmu lo ding; An ngai rero ding naón an thei thei lo ding. Ziangahtile an hmuh thei ih an theih thei ahcun, Pathian hnenah an kir ding ih Ngaithiam an si ding,’,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in, “Hi thlaici vorh tahṭhimnak hi nan thei thei lo maw? Cu a si ahcun ziangtinso tahṭhimnak dang teh nan theih thiam ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thlaici vorhtu in Pathian thu a vorh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat cu lamzin tluan ih a tlami thlaici bangtuk an si. Pathian thu cu an thei, asinain an theih vete in Satan a ra ih an sungih tuh mi thu cu a laksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat cu lungsedaap lakih a tlami thlaici bangtuk an si. Pathian thu an theih vete in lungawi zetin an pom.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an sungah thukpi a pil lo ih rei a daih lo. Cu ruangah Pathian thu ruangih harsatnak le hremnak a thlen tikah hmakhatte ah an leet sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat cu hlingbur lakih a tla mi thlaici bangtuk an si. Pathian thu cu an thei ngah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />asinain hi leilung tlun nunnak thu ih donharnak, len duhnak le a dang duhnak le helhkamnak dangdang in a ṭem ih a khuh ruangah rah an rah thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi dang cu leilung ṭhatnak ih a tlami thlaici bangtuk an si. Pathian thu cu an thei, an pom hnget ih rah an rah. Let sawmthum, let sawmruk le let zakhat tiangin an rah a si,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Zotal in mei-inn cu kho hnuai ah siseh, ihkhun hnuai ah siseh nan re dah maw? Mei-inn vannak tung parah nan ret ṭheu a si lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kelkawmih thuhmi pawl kha mipi hmuh ah langter a si ding ih a thupte ih tuahmi pawl kha phuan ṭheh a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Theihnak hna a neitu cun thei uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Nan theihmi kha ṭhatein ruat uh. Midang tahnak ih nan hmanmi kha Pathian in nanmah tahnak ah a hmang ve ding, cu hnakih nasa sawn hman in a hmang ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A neimi cu pek beet a si ding ih a nei lomi cu a neihsunmi hman kha lak sak a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Pathian Uknak cu hi bangtuk a si. Mi pakhat in a lo ah thlaici a vorh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zan ah a it, zingah a tho ih sunah hna a ṭuan, cuih sungah thlaici cu an rak kho ih an ṭhang. Asinain ziangtin cuvekin a cang, ti a thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Leilung in thlaici kho cu a ṭhangter ih rah a rahter, hmaisabik ah hnah no an suak, cuih hnuah an vui ih neta bikah a fang an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A fang a cut tikah hnaṭuantu pa in fang ah caan a cut ruangah fangahnak favah in a fang cu a at,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Pathian Uknak cu ziang bangtuk a si tiin so kan ti ding? Simfiangnak ah ziang tahṭhimnak so kan lak ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Anṭam ci bangtuk a si. Mi pakhat in leilung tlunih thlaici fate bik anṭam ci cu a lak ih leilung ah a vorh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tikcu malte hnuah a kho ih rawl kung dang hnakin a tum bikah a cang. Hnge le ṭeek tumpipi tla a nei thei ih vate tla cu a hnah hneem ah bu tla an sak,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hi bangtuk tahṭhimnak dangdang tla hmangin an hnenah an theih theinak ding tawpin thu a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tahṭhimnak hmang loin an hnenah thu a sim dah lo. Asinain a dungthlun pawl thawn anmah lawngih an um tikah ziang hmuahhmuah fiangtein a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cuih sun zanlam ah Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl cu, “Tili ih khatlam ralah va feh uh si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Curuangah misenpi pawl cu an taan ih dungthluntu pawl cu lawng sungah an lut. Cuih lawng sungah Jesuh cu a rak to zo ih lawng cun an fehpi. Cunah lawng dang pawl tla an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Rinlopi ah thlipi nasa zetin a hrang ih tilet tho cu lawng sungah a lut vivo ih lawng sungah cun tidai a khat zik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesuh cu lawng ih mei lamah a um ih tokham parah a rak itthat. Dungthluntu pawl cun an ṭhang ih, “Sayapa, kan hlohral thluh ding hi na poisa lo maw si?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesuh cu a hung tho ih thlipi cu, “Hrang nawn hlah!” tiah thu a pek ih tilet cu, “Dai aw!” tiah a ti. Cutikah thli cu hrang nawn loin a um ih tilet khal a dai khepkhep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl hnenah, “Ziangah so cuti lawmmam ih nan ṭih? Zumnak nan nei hrih lo maw si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cumi cu a mak tuk an ti ih an mang bangin pakhat le pakhat, “Hi pa hi zo bik so a si pei? Thlipi le tilet hmanin a thu an ngai hi!” tiah an ti aw rero.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Galilee Tili khatlam ral Gerasene peng ah an va thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesuh cu lawng sung ihsin a suah vete in cutawkah thlaan lungkua sungih a ummi pa a ra suak ih Jesuh a ra tong. Cupa cu khawsia ih polhmi a si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />thlaan lakih a ummi a si. Zohman ih hreen thei lomi pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Voi tampi thir cikcin rori in a kutke an ṭem ṭheu naón an ṭem tinte in thirhri cu a ticat ih a ke ṭemnak thirhri tla cu a botcat ṭheh, zohman a kaihrem theitu an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sun a zan ih thlaan lak le tlang lakah a vak ih a au phahphah ih amah le amah lungto in a sun, a at aw phah ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hla nawn ihsin Jesuh cu a hei hmu; a va tlan ih a hmai ah a khuk a bilh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a aw neih patawp in, “Maw Jesuh, Cungnungbik Pathian ih Fapa! Nang le kei ziangso kan seng aw? Pathian hmin in ka lo dil, i hrem hramhram hlah aw!” tiah a au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi bangtuk ih a aunak cu Jesuh in, “Thlarau siava, hi pa sung ihsin suak aw,” a rak ti ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in, “Na hmin zoso a si?” tiah a sut. Cupa cun, “Ka hmin cu ‘Burpi,’ a si, ziangahtile kan tam ngaingai a si,” tiah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cupa cun thlarau siava pawl cu cuih ram ihsih dawihlo lo dingah Jesuh cu a dil ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutawk kiangkap tlangmual ah vok rual tampi an tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thlarau siava pawl cun Jesuh cu, “Vok hnenah in thlah awla an sungah in lutter hram aw,” tiah an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A dil vek ih a fehter hai ih thlarau siava pawl cu cupa sung ihsin an suak ih vok sungah cun an lut. Cule vok rual cu thawnghnih hrawng an si ih khaamhraap ihsin an vung dawp ciammam ih tili sungah an tla that ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vok khaaltu pawl cu an tlan ih cuih thuhla cu khawsung ah le lo lakah an sim ciamco. Mipi pawl cu thil cangmi zoh dingah an va feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesuh hnenih an thlen tikah khawsia ‘Burpi,’ ih a rak polh mipa khal an va hmu. Cutawkah cun a to ih hnipuan hruk in le lungfim in an va hmu. Curuangah an thin a phang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih thil a hmutu pawl in khawsia polhmi pa le vok rual parah ziang vek thil a cang ti kha mipi pawl an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule an ram tlansan dingah Jesuh cu an dil ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesuh cu lawng sungih a luh zawng ah khawsia ih rak polh dahmi pa cun, “Na hnenah ka feh ve pei,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh in a duh lo. “Na inn ah va tlung sawn awla na sungte pawl hnenah Bawipa ih a lo tuah sakmi le a lo zaangfahnak thuhla pawl cu va sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuticun cupa cu Dekhapolis ram sung hmuahhmuah ah a feh ih Jesuh ih a tuah sakmi thuhla cu a sim. Cuih thu a theitu hmuahhmuah cu an mang a bang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesuh cu Tili khatlam ral ah a va feh sal. Cutawk Tilikap ahcun mi tampi Jesuh kiangkap ah an khawm aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sinakok uktu pakhat a si mi Jairas cu a ra ih Jesuh a hmuh tikah a ke hramah a bok ih zaangfahnak a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ka fanute besia zetin a na. Ra hram awla a parah na kut ra suang aw, cule a dam ding ih a nung ding a si,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu Jairas hnenah feh dingin a pok. Mitampi in Jesuh an thlun ruangah a kilkip in an run eng cupco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mitampi lakah cun thidok nat in kum hleihnih a na zomi nunau pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sibawi tampi in an tuah zo naón a dam cuang lo. A neihmi tangka hmuahhmuah a hmang zo naón a ṭha lam si loin a besia deuhdeuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cunu cun Jesuh thu a rak thei ih miburpi lakin Jesuh dunglam in a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“A puan ka tham thei ahcun ka dam ko ding,” tiah a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh puan cu a tham. Cutiih a tham vete in a thisuak cu a reh ih ka natnak ihsin ka dam zo ti kha a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesuh in a sung ihsin a huham a suah kha a thei lohli ih miburpi lamah her in, “Zoso ka puan a tham?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A dungthlun pawl in, “Miburpi in an lo nor cupco hi na hmu ko. Ziangtin so ‘Zoso ka puan a tham?’ na ti,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh cun ka puan a thamtu cu zo bik so a si, tiah a zoh rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cutiih thil a cangmi cu nunau nu in a theih tikah ṭih le ṭhia phah in a ra ih Jesuh kehram ah a khuk a bilh ih thudik kha a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in a hnenah, “Ka fanu, na zumnak in a lo damter zo. Dai tein va feh aw, na natnak cu damta seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesuh cutiih a ṭong rero laiah cun Jairas inn ihsin thlahmi zualko an ra thleng ih Jairas cu, “Na fanu a thi zo. Ziangah so Sayapa cu na hnaihnok duh nawn rero,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesuh in cuih thu an simmi cu ziang hmanah a siar lo ih Jairas hnenah cun, “Zianghman phang hlah, a zum lawng zum aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in Piter le Jeim le a nau Johan siar lo zohman amah a thlunter siang nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jairas inn cu an va thleng ih ṭapraak le hnok ceelceel ih an um kha Jesuh in a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An hnenah a vung lut ih, “Ziangah so hnok ceelceel ih nan um? Ziangah so nan ṭah nan raak! Hi nauhak nu hi a thih ual lo; a itthat a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Annih in Jesuh cu an hnihsan meen. Curuangah an zatein khawlengah a suahter ṭheh. Nauhak nu ih nu le pa le a dungthlun pathum cu a ko ih nauhak nu an retnak khaan sungah cun an vung lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nauhak nu cu a kut in a vun kai ih, “Talitha koumi,” tiah a ti. Cumi cu, “Nute tho aw ka lo ti,” tican a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hmakhatteah nauhak nu cu a tho ih a feh thei. (Amah cu kum hleihnih mi a si.) Cumi an hmuh tikah an mang a bangtuk lawmmam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh in zohman sim lo dingin thu a pek ih, “Ei ding ziangmaw tal pek uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh cu cutawk ihsin a feh ih a khua ah a dungthlun pawl thawn an kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sabbath ni ah an sinakok sungah thu a zirh. Cunah mi tampi an um ih a thuzirhmi an theih tikah an mang a bang ngaingai. “Hi hmuahhmuah hi khuiinso a lak? Hi bangtuk fimnak hi khuiinso a ngah? Ziangtin so mangbangza hi a tuah thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mari fapa lettama, Jeim le Josef le Judas le Simon teih u kha a si lo sawm? A farnu pawl tla hinah an um lai a si lo maw?” an ti. Cuticun Jesuh cu zianghman ah an rel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesuh in ah hnenah, “Profet cu amah ih suahnak khua le ram, a sungkhat le a innsang siar lo hmun dangah cuh upatnak a tong a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutawkah cun mina malte parah a kut a suang ih a damter; cumi siar lo mangbangza zianghman a tuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zumnak an neih lo ruangah Jesuh cu a mang a bang ngaingai. Cule Jesuh cu kiangkap khua ah a feh ih thu a zirh vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dungthluntu hleihnih kha a ko ih pahnih pahnih in a thlah. Ramhuai neh theinak thu a pek ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Khual nan tlawnnak ah kianghrol siar lo a dang zianghman nan keng lo pei: rawl siseh, cawdip siseh, nan kordip ah tangka siseh nan keng lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kedam cu dam uh, asinain angki a hlei in keng hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlun-inn a lo ontu ih inn ah khua dangih nan feh sal hlan lo caam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nan thlennak khua pakhat in, tlun-inn an lo on duh lo ih nan thu khal an ngai duh lo a si ahcun, tlansan uhla nan ke ih leivut kha thinta uh. Cumi cu an hrangah ralrin peknak a si ding,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuticun an feh ih mi hmuahhmuah an sualnak sir aw dingah thu an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ramhuai tampi an dawi ih mina tampi tla olif hriak an culh ih an damter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesuh thuhla cu khuazakipih a than ruangah Siangpahrang Herod tla in cuih thu cu a thei ve. Mi hrekkhat cun, “Baptisma petu Johan kha a nung sal a si! Curuangah hi bangtuk in mangbangza tuah theinak huham a nei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi dang cun, “Elijah a si,” an ti. Mi dang cun, “Khuahlan laiih profet pawl vek profet pakhat a si ko,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cumi cu Herod in a theih ve tikah, “Baptisma petu Johan a si! A lu ka rak tanter zomi a si naón a nung sal a si hi!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Johan cu kaih ih thirhri in khit tahratin thawng thlak dingah Herod amah rori in thu a rak pek dahmi a si. Ziangah cutin a tuah tile, Herod in a nau Filip ih nupi Herodias a ṭhit hrangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Johan in, “Na naupa ih nupi na ṭhit cu a dik lo a si,” tiah Herod kha a ti ringring ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah Herodias in Johan cu a mitkem in a ngiar ringring ih thah tiangin a duh; a sinan Herod a um ruangah zianghman a ti ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Herod in Johan cu a ṭih ngaingai, ziangahtile Johan cu mi ṭha le mi thianghlim a si ti a thei. Curuangah a hum ṭheu. Johan ih thusimmi a ngaitinte a thin a nuam dah lo, asinain a thusimmi ngai cu a duh thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Neta bikah Herodias cu caan ṭha a ngah. Herod suahcam a hung kim ih a suahcam lomnak ah Herod cun Acozah bawi upa pawl, a ralkap uktu ralbawi pawl le Galilee rammi upa pawl hrangah rawl darnak puai a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Herodias fanu cu a rung lut ih a laam tikah Herod le a sawmmi upa pawl cu an lung a awi ngaingai. Curuangah Siangpahrang bawipa in falanu hnenah cun, “Ziang so na duh? Na duh mi hmuahhmuah ka lo pe ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Na dilmi pohpoh ka lo pe ding; ka ram ukmi a hrek tiang hman ka lo pe ding,” tiah siatcam in thu a kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule falanu cu a feh ih a nu hnenah, “Ziang so ka dil ding?” tiah a va sut. A nu in, “Baptisma petu Johan ih lu dil aw,” tiah a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Falanu cu zamrang tein a kir ih Siangpahrang bawipa cu, “Atu ah hitawk rori ah hin baptisma petu Johan ih lu cu darkheng in i pe cila ka duh!” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cumi a theih tikah Siangpahrang cu a riah a sia ngaingai, asinain a sawmmi bawi le upa pawl hmaiih siatcam in thu a kam awk zo ruangah falanu ih a dilmi cu a el thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Curuangah hmakhatte ah ralkap pakhat a thlah ih Johan ih lu rak keng dingin thu a pek. Ralkap pa cu a suak ih thawnginn ahcun a feh ih Johan ih lu cu a va tan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cuih hnuah darkheng in a rak keng ih falanu cu a pek, falanu cun a nu hnenah a pek sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuih thu cu Johan ih dungthluntu pawl in an theih tikah a ruak an ra lak ih an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A thlahmi pawl cu an ra tlung ih Jesuh cu an tong ih an tuahmi hmuahhmuah le an zirhmi hmuahhmuah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A hnenih a rami le a kirmi, mi sukso pawl cu an tamtuk ruangah Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu rawl einak caan hman an nei lo. Cu hrangah an hnenah, “Kan feh pei ih kanmah lawng hlimphirte ih kan um theinak hmunah va um uh si; cule malte tal nan cawl thiam ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuticun anmah lawng hlimphirte ih um theinak hmun feh dingah lawng in an pok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Asinain an feh kha mi tampi in an hmu ih zo an si ti kha hmakhatte ah an thei. Curuangah khua hmuahhmuah ihsin an pok ih an ke in an rak tlan ih Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu an colhnak ding hmunah an rak thlen khelh vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh cu lawng sung ihsin a suah tikah miburpi cu a hmu ih a thinlung cu anmah zaangfahnak in a khat, ziangahtile khaaltu nei lo tuurual bangtuk an si. Curuangah thu tampi a zirh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zanlam khua a hung siim tikah a dungthluntu pawl cu a hnenah an ra ih, “Khua a siim zo; hitawk hi hmunṭhing a si fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Miburpi pawl hi thlah awla ziang lo ei ṭha an lei theinak dingah kiangkap khua pawl le lo tla ah va feh hai seh,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesuh cun, “Nanmah in an ei ding cu pek uh,” tiah a ti. Cutikah annih in, “Tangka zahnih man rawl va lei tahratin himi pawl hi rawl daar uh, ti in duh maw si?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesuh in, “sang ziangzat so nan neih? Va zohhnik uh,” tiah a ti. An va zoh ih, “sang hlom nga le nga pum hnih a um,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl hnenah mipi pawl kha hram hring parah a bur a bur in toter dingah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cutiin misenpi cu zakhat tlar le sawmnga tlar in an to khawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cun Jesuh in sang hlom nga le nga pum hnih cu a lak ih vanlam hawi in Pathian hnenah lungawinak thu a sim. Sang cu a phel ih mipi pawl zem dingah a dungthluntu pawl hnenah a pek. Nga pum hnih khal cu an zate hnenah a zem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An zatein an ei ih an khopzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Sang le nga an hlahmi cu dungthluntu pawl in an sar ih bawm hleihnih an ngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Rawl a eitu cu mipa lawnglawng siar in thawng nga an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Cuih hnuah zamrangte in Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl cu lawng sungah a luhter ih tili khatlam ral Bethsaida ah a hmaiah rak feh sung dingin a thlah. Cule misenpi pawl cu a tlunter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Cibai a buk hai hnuah tlang parah thlacam dingah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Khua a thim tikah lawng cu tili laifang a thleng ih Jesuh cu amah lawng tlang parah a um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Thli kha anmah lamih a hran ruangah a dungthluntu pawl in lawng an hlau tikah harnak tampi an tong ti kha a hei hmu. Curuangah zinglam khawvang deuh hlanah an hnenah cun ti parin a va feh. An kiang a thlen tikah lansan a tum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />asinain ti parih a feh kha an hmu. Mithla ah an ruat ih an thin phangin an raak ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />An hmuh tikah an zatein an ṭih ngaingai. Hmakhatteah Jesuh in, “Nan thinphang hlah uh! Keimah ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Cule lawng sungah an hnenah a vung lut ih thli cu a dai. Dungthluntu pawl cu an mang a bangzet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />ziangahtile mi thawng nga rawl a daarnak kha a sullam an thei thei lo, an thinlung in a ruat ban lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tili an tan hnuah Gennesaret ah an va thleng ih cuih hmunah an lawng cu an hreng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Long sung ihsin an suah vete in mipi in Jesuh cu an theithiam lohli.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Curuangah cutawk ramah cun zamrangin an feh ih a umnak an theihnak hmun poh ah mina pawl cu laang in an rak zawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Cun Jesuh a fehnak pohpoh ah khawte ah siseh, khawpi ah siseh, lo lak khalah siseh, an mina pawl cu dawrhmun khalah an rak thlenpi hai ih, “Na puanfeem tal lo tham hai seh,” tiah an dil; cule a puanfeem a tham ngahtu cu an dam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem ihsin a rami Farasi ṭhenkhat le Daanthiam ṭhenkhat pawl cu Jesuh hnenah an va leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A dungthluntu hrekkhat pawl cu kut kholh loih rawl an ei kha an hmu; rawl ei hlanah nan kut nan kholh ding, timi vekin an kut an kholh lo, tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangahtile Farasi mi siseh, Judah mi dangdang pawl siseh, an zatein an pupa pawl ih thuzirhnak kha an thlun; a daan vekin an kut an kholhta lo ahcun rawl an ei lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />cule dawrih an leimi thil khal a daan vekih an kholhta lo ahcun an ei duh lo. Cun an pupa pawl ih thuzirhmi khuathai kholh daan, beel kholh daan, darkheng kholh daan le ihkhun kholh daan ti pawl tla an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah Farasi mi pawl le Daanthiam pawl in Jesuh cu, “Ziangah so na dungthluntu pawl in kan pupa pawl ih in zirhta mi daan vekin nung loin kut kholh lo pi thawn rawl an ei?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Profet Isaiah in nanmah ih thuhla a rak sim tikah a va dik lawmmam so! Nannih mititeraw pawl, nan thu cu hiti in a ngan: Pathian in ‘Hi minung pawl hin an ṭongkam lawngin in upat; An thinlung cu ka hnen ihsin a hlat ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keimah in biak hi a lak a si, Ziangahtile milai ih tuahcopmi daan kha Pathian ih pekmi daan vekin an zirh a si,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian thupekmi cu nan taan ih milai ih zirhmi sawn cu nan thlun a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in a peh ih, “Nanmah ih thuzirhmi fekter ih Pathian pekmi daan hnon zia cu nan va thiam so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile Moses thupekmi sungah ‘Nan nu le nan pa upat uh,’ tile ‘A nu siseh, a pa siseh, a camtu cu thah a si ding,’ tiah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nannih cun ‘Mi pakhat in a nu le a pa kha: nanmah bomnak hrangah ka timi ka thilri hi Korban a si, a ti ahcun, (Korban ti cu Pathian ta a si tican a si)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />cupa cu a nu le a pa bomnak ihsin a luat,’ tiah nan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutiih mi nan zirhmi in Pathian ṭongkam cu a phiat ṭheh a si. Cule cu bangtuk ih nan tuahmi dangdang tla tampi a um,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in misenpi kha a ko sal ih an hnenah, “Nan zatein ka thusimmi hi ngai uhla thei uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minung hi lenglam ihsin sung lamah a lutmi thil in a baalter lo. A sunglam ihsin a ra suakmi in a baalter sawn a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh in misenpi pawl cu a fehsan ih inn sungih a luh tikah a dungthluntu pawl cu cuih a ṭongmi sullam sut dingah an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Midang pawl hnakin nan fim cuang lo a sihi! Nan thei lo ngaingai maw? Lenglam ihsin minung sungah a lutmi in mi a baalter thei lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ziangahtile cuih thil cu a thinlung sungah feh loin a pumpi sungah a feh ih cuticun zunpawng ah a suak sal a si,” tiah a ti. (Hitiin Jesuh ih a sim tikah ziang bangtuk rawl hman hi ei thiang an si ṭheh ko, tiah a ti duhnak a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in, “Mi a baaltertu ngaingai cu a sunglam ihsin a suakmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ziangahtile ṭhatlonak a tuahtertu ruahnak ṭha lo pawl cu minung sunglam ihsin a suakmi an si: nupa sualnak, rukruk, mithah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ṭaangṭawm sualnak, duhham, thil siava dangdang tuah, mibum, a mawi lo zetmi thilsual tuah, iksiik, misimsiat, puarthau le aat-thlakza thil tuahnak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />hi thil siava pawl hi minung thinlung sung ihsin a suakmi an si ih hi pawl hin mi an baalter a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu a feh ih Tai-ar khua kiang a hung thleng. Inn pakhat sungah a lut ih cutawkah a um ti zohman theihter a duh lo; asinain a thup aw thei cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cu ngaingai in, a fanu ramhuai ih a kaihmi nunau pakhat in Jesuh a um ti kha a thei ih hmakhatte ah Jesuh kehram ah a bok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih nunau nu cu Zentail nu a si ih Siria ram Fonisia pengih a suakmi a si. Ramhuai kha a fanu sung ihsin dawisuak dingah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh cun, “Rawl cu faale pawl kan pek hmaisa pei. Faale pawl ih rawl uico pek cu a dik lo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cu nu cun, “A si ko, Bawipa! Sikhalsehla faale pawl ih hlahtakmi rawl ṭilfuan cu cabuai hnuai ih uico pawl in an ei ve ṭheu ko a sisi!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh in, “Cutiih i leh thei ruangah inn ah va tlung awla na fanu sung ihsin ramhuai cu a suak zo ti na va hmu ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Inn ah a tlung ih a fanu cu ihkhun parih a rak ih kha a va hmu. Ramhuai cu a sung ihsin a rak suak zo ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule Tai-ar peng ihsin Jesuh cu a pok ih Sidon ram pal phah in Dekhapolis ram laifang a hruut ih Galilee Tili a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat in a hnenah hnaset ṭong thiam lo pa pakhat an rak keng ih a parah Jesuh in a kut suang dingin an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh in cupa cu mipi hnen ihsin hmun dangdeuh ah a hruai ih a kut zungin a hna pahnih cu a tawhsak; cil a phui ih a lei a thamsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cule vanlam hoi in Jesuh cu a hruum ih cupa hnen ahcun, “Effatha,” tiah a ti. Atican cu “Ong aw thlang aw,” tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hmakhatteah cupa cu a hna a vaang, a lei a naal ih har lotein a ṭong thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cuih thu cu zo hnen hmanah sim lo dingin Jesuh in mipi pawl cu a dawn. Asinain tam deuh a dawn hai tikah tam deuhdeuh in an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule cuih thu a theitu hmuahhmuah in an mang a bang ngaingai ih, “A tuahmi hmuah in an va ṭha lawmmam so! Hnaset mi an hna a vaang ih ṭong thiam lo tla an ṭong thei,” tiah an fak ciamco.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih hnu rei lote-ah mi tampi an pumkhawm aw lala. Mipi cu rawl ei ding an neih lo tikah Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl kha a ko ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hi mi pawl hi ni thum sung ka hnenah an um zo ih atu-ah ei ding zianghman an nei nawn lo; ka zaang an fakzet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rawl ziang hman ei loih ka tlunter a si ahcun mi hrekkhat cu lam hlapi feh ding an si ruangah lamzin ah an ṭamsawl ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A dungthluntu pawl cun, “Hi bangtuk ramṭhing ah hin zo in so milai hi zat hrangah rawl cu a hawl thei ding?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesuh in, “sang hlom ziangzatso nan neih?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “Hlom sarih,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesuh in misenpi cu lei parah to dingin thu a pek. Cule sang hlom sarih cu a lak ih Pathian hnenah lungawithu a sim hnuah a phel ih mipi zem dingah a dungthluntu pawl a pek; a dungthluntu pawl cun an zem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nga fatete khal malte lai an nei. Jesuh in Pathian hnenah lungawithu a sim hnuah nga khal zem dingin a dungthluntu pawl a fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An zatein an ei ih an khopzet, minung cu thawngli tluk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule an hlahmi kha dungthluntu pawl in an sar ih bawm sarih a ti. Jesuh in mipi pawl cu a tlunter ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hmakhatte ah lawng sungah a dungthluntu pawl thawn an lut ih Dalmanutha pengah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Farasi mi hrekkhat pawl Jesuh hnenah an ra ih thu an el aw. Jesuh ih sual hawl an duh ruangah, “Pathian hrilmi na si le si lo langternak ah mangbangza tuahhnik,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesuh cu lungkim lo zetin a hruum ih, “Ziangah so tuihsan minung pawl in mangbangza tuah in fial? Thungai in ka lo sim: cubangtuk mangbangza cu tuihsan minung hnenah pek a si lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A fehsan ih lawng sungih a luh hnuah tili khatlam ralah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl in sang ken an hngilh ih lawng sungah sang hlom khat lawng a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Farasi mi le Herod ih thilnu kha ralring uh,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Annih in, “sang kan neih lo ruangah a si, hiti ih in ti,” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cumi cu Jesuh in a thei ih an hnenah, “sang nan neih lo thu cu ziangah so nan rel rero? Nan thei thei hrih lo maw? Cutluk in maw nan ruah ban lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mit nan neih si, nan hmu thei lo maw? Hna nan neih si, nan thei thei lo maw? Mi thawng nga hrangih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sang hlom nga ka phel kha nan cing nawn lo maw? An hlahmi sang bawm ziangzat so nan sar kha?” a ti. Annih in, “Bawm hleihnih,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Cun minung thawngli hrangah sang hlawm sarih ka phel tikah an hlahmi bawm ziangzat so nan sar kha?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “Bawm sarih,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Cuih hnu khalah nan thei thei hrih lo maw?” tiah a ti hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bethsaida khua an thleng ih cutawkah mitcawpa pakhat Jesuh hnenah an rak hruai ih Jesuh ih tham dingin an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh in mitcawpa cu a kut in a hruai ih hnarpawn ah a fehpi. A mit ah a cil a vun phui hnuah a parah a kut a suang ih, “Ziangtal na hmu thei maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mitcawpa cu vantau in khua a hun zoh ih, “A si, mi ka hmu thei; asinain thingkung feh rero vek an bang,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesuh in cupa ih mit ahcun a kut a suang lala. Mitcawpa cun napiin khua a hun zoh ih a mit cu a vaan ngah ruangah ziang hmuahhmuah fiangtein a hmu thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesuh in innah a tlunter ih, “Khawsungah va lut nawn hlah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Sisaria Filipi kiang khawte pawl tlawng dingah an feh. Lamzin ah dungthluntu pawl cu, “Mi in zo in ti so, in simhnik uh?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Annih in, “Mi hrekkhat in baptisma petu Johan a si, an lo ti. Mi hrek in Elijah a si an lo ti. Midang in profet pakhatkhat a si, an lo ti,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nannih in teh, zo in ti so?” tiah a sut. Piter in, “Nang cu Messiah na si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh in, “Cuih thu cu zohman va sim hlah uh,” tiah a tiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl a zirh ih, “Milai Fapa cu tuarnak nasazet a tong ding ih upa pawl, puithiam upa pawl le Daan thiam pawl in an hnong ding; an that ding, asinain ni thum hnuah a tho sal ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuih thu cu an hnenah fiang zetin a sim. Curuangah Piter in Jesuh cu a dang deuh ah a pialpi ih a mawhthluk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh cu a her ih a dungthluntu pawl zoh phah in Piter cu, “Satan, ka hnen ihsin tlan aw! Na ruahdan hi Pathian hnen ihsin rami a si lo, milai hnen ihsin rami a si,” tiah a kawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in mipi le a dungthluntu pawl cu a hnenah a ko ih, “Zokhal keimah i thlun duhtu cun amah ih duhnak taanta sehla a thinglamtah pu in i thlunseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ziangahtile zokhal amah ih nunnak hum a duhtu cu a nunnak a sung ding; asinain keimah ih hrang le Thuthang ṭha ruangah a nunnak a liamtu cu a nunnak a hum ngah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi pakhat in leilung pumpuluk co hmansehla amah ih nunnak a sun ahcun ziangso a ṭhahnem? Zianghman a ṭhahnem lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A nunnak kha zianghman in a lei thei sal nawn lo ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuihsan, Pathian zianghman ih siar lo san, hi san ṭha lo ah hin mi pakhatkhat in keimah siseh, ka thuzirhmi siseh, a zahpi ahcun Milai Fapa in a Pa ih sunlawinak le vancung mithiang pawl thawn a rat tikah a zahpi ve ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thungai in ka lo sim: hi tawkih a ummi mi ṭhenkhat pawl hi Pathian Uknak huham thawn a ra thlen an rak hmuh hlan lo an thi lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni ruk hnuah Jesuh in Piter le Jeim le Johan cu a fehpi ih tlang parah anmah lawng a kaipi. An mit hmuhah Jesuh cu a hmuihhmel a thleng aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a hnipuan cu a tleu in a tleu ih milai in ziangtluk hmanin sawp hai sehla cutluk cun a vaar thei dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule dungthluntu pathum cun Elijah le Moses thawn Jesuh cu bia aw rero in an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Piter in Jesuh hnenah, “Sayapa, hitawk kan um cu a va ṭha so! Deubuk pathum in kan sak pei; na hrangah pakhat, Moses hrangah pakhat, cule Elijah hrangah pakhat,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ziangahtile Piter le a rualpi pawl cu an thin a phang tuk ih ziang ṭong ding dang an theih lo ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih hnuah mero a ra zaam ih an tlun ihsin a run khuh ṭheh, cule mero sung ihsin, “Himi cu ka duhdawtmi ka Fapa a si, amah ih thu nan ngai pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A dungthluntu pathum cun an kiangkap an zoh rero naón zohman an hmu lo; Jesuh lawng an kiangih a um kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tlangpar ihsin an rung ṭum laiah Jesuh in, “Milai Fapa hi thihnak ihsin ka thawhsal hlan cu nan hmuhmi hi zohman nan sim lo pei,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih a thupekmi cu an thlun; asinain, “Thihnak ihsin thawhsal,” timi cu ziang a si pei? tiah pakhat le pakhat an sut aw rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu, “Ziangah so Daanthiam pawl in Elijah a ra hmaisa ding, an ti?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesuh cun, “Ziang hmuahhmuah timtuah ṭheh dingah Elijah cu a ra taktak ding. Asinain ziangah so Ca Thianghlim in ‘Milai Fapa cu nasa zetin a tuar ding ih a hnon tla an hnong ding,’ tiah a ti?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thungai in ka lo sim: Elijah cu a ra zo ih, Ca Thianghlim ih a sim vekin minung in an duhduh in an tuah zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dungthluntu dang pawl hnen an vung thlen tikah an kiangkap in mitampi in an kulhvel ih Daanthiam hrekkhat pawl le dungthluntu cu thu an el awk rero kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Misenpi in Jesuh kha an hmuh tikah an mang a bang ngaingai ih va hmuak dingah an tlan ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl cu, “Anmah thawn ziangthu so nan el awk rero?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Misenpi lakih mi pakhat in, “Sayapa, ka fapa na hnenah ka rak hruai sokhaw; ziangahtile ramhuai in a polh ih ṭong khal a ṭong thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ramhuai in a polh tikah cun, leilung ah a hlon aw ih a cil buanra a suak ih a hacang rial tahratin a pumpuluk a ṭhong ṭheh ṭheu. Cuih ramhuai dawisuak dingah na dungthluntu pawl ka sim naón zianghman an ti thei lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Maw zumnak nei lo minung pawl! Nan hnenah ziangtik tiangso ka um hrih ding? Ziangtik tiangso ka lo zawi hrih hai ding? Nauhakpa cu ka hnenah rak keng uh,” tiah a ti ih
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh hnenah cun an ratpi. Ramhuai in Jesuh a hmuh vete in nauhakpa cu a dirhcaih ih leilung ah a tlu, a let aw tualto ih a ka ihsin buanra a suak ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Hitiih a sinak hi a rei zo maw?” tiah a pa cu a sut. A pa in, “A seentet lai ihsin a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Voi tampi ramhuai hin that dingin meisa lak le tidai sungah a paih ṭheu. Na tuah theimi a si ahcun in zaangfah awla in bawm hram aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Na tuah theimi a si ahcun, na ti. A si! Zumnak neitu hrangah cun ziang hmuahhmuah a cang thei a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cupa cun hmakhatte ah, “Ka zum a si; ka zum kim lonak i bawm aw,” tiah a au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesuh cun misenpi in a kiangah an ra fuk vivo ti a hmuh tikah ramhuai kha thu a pek ih, “Hnaset le ṭong thiam lo thlarau siava, hi nauhak pa sung ihsin suak awla lut sal nawn hlah, tiah thu ka lo pek,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ramhuai cu a hruum ih nauhak pa kha dircai phah in a thlukta ih a sung ihsin a suak. Nauhak pa cu mithi a bang ih mi tampi in, “A thi zo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh in nauhak pa cu a kut in a vun dirh ih a hung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesuh cu inn sungah a lut ih dungthluntu pawl in a thupte in, “Ziangah so kannih hmuah in kan dawi thei lo?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Thlacamnak dah ti lo, thildang zianghman in hi bangtuk cu a dawi thei lo ding,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu cutawk ihsin an pok ih Galilee peng tan phah in an feh. Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl thu a zirh vivo ruangah midang zohman in a umnak thei dingah a duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ziangtin a zirh tile: “Milai Fapa hi mi kut ah an thlen ding ih an that ding. Asinain ni thum hnuah a tho sal ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sikhalsehla cuti ih a zirhmi cu an thei thei lo. A suh le an sut ngam fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kapernaum khua an thleng ih inn sungih an luh hnuah Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl cu, “Lamzin ah ziangthu so nan el awk rero kha?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A thu suhmi cu zohman in an let lo, ziangahtile lamzinih an el awkmi cu anmah lakah zoso a tum bik ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesuh cu a to ih dungthluntu hleihnih a ko ih an hnenah, “A tum bik si a duhtu cu mi nauta bik a si hmaisa ding ih mi hmuahhmuah riantu a si pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cule nauhak pakhat a ko ih an hmaiah a dinter. Nauhak pate cu Jesuh in a kuah ih an hmaiah a dinter hnuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Zokhal sisehla ka hmin in hi bangtuk nauhak a cohlangtu cu keimah i cohlang a si; cule keimah i cohlangtu cu keimah i thlahtu khal a cohlang a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Johan in, “Sayapa, na hmin in khawsia a dawisuaktu mi pakhat kan hmu ih kan lak ih tel vemi a si lo ruangah kan khamta,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Kham hlah uh! Ziangahtile ka hmin in mangbangza a tuahtu cun i simsia lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ziangahtile in dodal lotu cu kanmah lam ṭang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: Ka minung nan si ruangih tidai khuat khat a lo petu cu ṭhatman a ngah tengteng ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Zokhal sisehla hi bangtuk nauhakte pawl pakhatkhat keimah i rinsannak ihsin a pialtertu cu a hngawng ah fangcang rialnak lungtum thlaih tahratin tifinriat sungih thlak a hrangah a ṭha sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Curuangah na kut in na zumnak a lo pialter a si ahcun na kut cu tan aw! Na kut pahnih thawn a mit dah lomi hell meisa sungih na tlak hnak cun kut pakhat lawng thawn nunnak sungih na luh a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Cule na ke in na zumnak a lo pialter a si ahcun na ke cu tan aw. Na ke pahnih thawn hell sungih tlak hnak cun ke pakhat lawng thawn nunnak sungih na luh a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Cule na mit in na zumnak a lo pialter a si ahcun na mit cu phorh suak aw. Mit pahnih thawn hell sungih tlak hnak cun mit pakhat lawng thawn Pathian Uknak sungih na luh a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cutawkah ‘anmah a eitu tholung pawl cu an thi dah lo ih anmah kangtu meisa khal a mit dah lo a si.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Thawinak sa cu ci in thianfaiter a si vekin mi hmuahhmuah cu meisa in thianfaiter thluh an si ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />“Ci cu a ṭha. Sikhalsehla a alnak a ziam asile ziangtinso na alter sal thei nawn ding? “Ci bangtuk in a ṭha mi pawlkomnak nei uhla pakhat le pakhat rualremte in um uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu cutawk hmun in a suak ih Judea peng ah a feh ih Jordan Tiva a tan. Tiva ral khat ahcun miburpi in an pan thotho ih a zirh keel vekin thu a zirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Farasi mi hrekkhat a sual hawl duh ah an ra; annih in, “In sim hnik! Mipa in a nupi maak dingah kan Daan in a thlah maw?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ziangbangtuk daan so Moses in a lo pek?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Annih in, “Moses cun nupi maaknak ca nan ngan pei ih nan maak thei ding in ti,” tiah an let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Nan thinlung a ruh tuk ih zirh theih nan si lo ruangah Moses in hi bangtuk daan cu a lo pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain a hramthok, lei le van seemsuah a si laiah cun Ca Thianghlim ih a sim vekin ‘Pathian in mipa le nunau a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah mipa in a nu le a pa a taanta ding ih a nupi thawn an kom aw ding ih pumkhat ah an cang ding,’ tiah a ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cu a si ruangah annih cu pahnih an si nawn lo, pakhat an si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ih a kommi cu zohman in ṭhen hlah hai seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inn sungih an luh sal tikah a dungthluntu pawl in cuih thu cu an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesuh cun an hnenah, “Mi pakhat in a nupi a maak ih nunau dang a ṭhit asile a nupi par ihsih nunau dang thawn ṭaangṭawm sualnak a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuvek thotho in nunau in a pasal a taan ih mipa dang a neih ahcun ṭaangṭawm sualnak a tuah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat in an faate pawl kha Jesuh in thlawsuah pe dingah an rak hruai. Asinain cu pawl cu a dungthluntu pawl in an rak kawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih thu cu Jesuh ih a theih tikah a thin a heng ih a dungthluntu pawl hnenah, “Nauhak pawl cu ka hnenah ra hai seh, dawn hlah uh. Ziangahtile Pathian Uknak cu hi bangtuk nauhak pawl hrangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: zokhal sisehla nauhak bangtuk in Pathian Uknak an cohlang lo ahcun cuih Pathian Uknak sungah an lut thei dah lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule nauhak pawl cu a pom ih an parah a kut a suang fingfing ih thlawsuah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh cu khual tlawng dingih a pawh zawng ah mi pakhat a hnenah a ra tlan ih a khuk bilh tahrat in, “Zirhtu ṭha, kumkhua nunnak ka co theinak dingah ziangso ka tuah ding?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ziangah so zirhtu ṭha i ti? Pathian siar lo zohman mi ṭha an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thukham pawl cu na thei a sisi. ‘Mi that hlah; ṭaangṭawm sualnak tuah hlah; rukru hlah; a dik loin midang sual puh hlah; mi va bum hlah; na nu le na pa upat aw,’ ti an si kha,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cupa cun, “Sayapa, hi thukham pawl cu ka nauhak lai ihsin ka thlun ṭheh ciami an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesuh in cupa cu duhdawtnak thawn a zoh hliah ih, “Thil pakhat na sam lai. Va feh awla na neihmi hmuahhmuah zuar in tangka na ngah mi kha mifarah va pe awla vancung ah hlawnthil tampi na nei ding. Cuih hnuah i ra thlun aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih thu a theih tikah mithmai sia le riahsia in a feh; ziangahtile amah cu milian ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl cu a zoh vivo hai ih, “Milian pawl hrangah Pathian Uknak sungih luh cu ziangtlukin so a har ding!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cumi an theih tikah dungthluntu pawl cu an mang a bang ngaingai; asinain Jesuh cun a sim beet ih, “Ka faale tla, Pathian Uknak sung luh ding hi ziangtlukin so a har!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Pathian Uknak sungih milian pa a luh ding hnak cun ṭhimte hnakua sungih kalauk a luh a ol sawn ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih thu an theih tikah dungthluntu pawl cu an mang a bang sinsin ih, “Cuti a si ahcun zoso runnak a ngah thei ding?” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl cu hmaiton tein a zoh ih, “Himi hi milai hrangah cun a cang thei lo; Pathian hrang lawngah a cang thei. Ziangahtile Pathian hrangah cun a cang thei lomi zianghman a um lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah Piter in, “A si ahcun kannih hi ziang hmuahhmuah kan tlansan ih nangmah kan lo thlun zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesuh in, “A si, thungai in ka lo sim: zokhal sisehla a inn siseh, a lo siseh, a unau siseh, a farnu siseh, a nu le a pa siseh, a faate pawl siseh, keimah le Thuthang ṭha ruangah a tlansantu cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tuihsan hrimhrim ah hin tam sinsin a ngah ding. Inn siseh, lo siseh, unau siseh, farnu siseh, nu siseh, faate siseh, a let zakhat in a ngah ding; cuih tlunah hremnak khal a ngah ve ding. Cule a ra dingmi sanah kumkhua nunnak a ngah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sikhalsehla atuih hmaisa bik a si mi tampi cu neta bik an si ding, cule atuih neta bik a si mi tampi cu hmaisa bik an si leh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Jerusalem lam ah an feh laiah Jesuh cu an hmaiah a rak feh; a dungthluntu pawl cu an thin a nuam lo. An dung ihsin a thluntu midang pawl khal an thin a phangzet. Dungthluntu hleihnih pawl cu hmun dang deuh ah a hruai ih a parih a ra thleng dingmi thil pawl cu a sim sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anih in, “Ngaihnik uh! Jerusalem khua kan thleng ding ih cutawkah Milai Fapa hi puithiam upa pawl le Daanthiam pawl kut ah pek a si ding. Annih in thah dingin thu an relcat ding ih cuih hnuah Zentail mi pawl kut ah thlenter a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hnihsuahsainak ah an hmang ding, cil an phui ding, an vuak ding ih an that ding. Asinain ni thum hnuah a tho sal ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cule Zebedi ih fapa Jeim le Johan cu Jesuh hnenah an ra ih “Sayapa, thil pakhat in tuahsak hram dingah kan duh,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ziang so nan duhmi cu a si?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Annih in, “A sunglawimi na Uknak sungih na bawi tokham parih na to tikah na kiangah in toter ve hram aw; pakhat na vorhlam ah, pakhat na kehlam ah,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesuh cun an hnenah, “Ziang kan dil tihi nan thei lo. Ka in dingmi tuarnak khuathai hi nan in thei ding maw? Baptisma ka lak vek rori in nan lak thei ve ding maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Annih in, “Kan ti thei ding,” tiah an let. Jesuh in an hnenah, “Ka in dingmi khuathai hi nan in thei ngai ko ding ih baptisma ka lak vekin nan lak thei ve ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka vorhlam le ka kehlam ih totu ding hril theinak cu keiih thu a si lo. Pathian in hi hmun cu a timtuah sak ciami pawl hnenah a pe ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cuih thu cu dungthluntu dang pahra pawl in an theih tikah Jeim le Johan parah an thin a heng ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh in an zatein a kokhawm ih, “Leitlun ram uktu pawl cu an ukmi pawl kha an lal-hnawh ih an hotu pawl tla cu thu an nei nasa ti cu nan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Asinain nannih lakah cun hi bangtuk cun a si lo pei. Nanmah lakah pakhat in a tum bik si a duh ahcun nan zate riantu a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nanmah lakah pakhatnak si a duhtu cun nan zate sal a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ziangahtile Milai Fapa hman hi rianmi si loin miriantu si dingah le mi tampi tlen dingah a nunnak pe dingin a ra a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl le miburpi cu Jerikho khua an thleng. Cule Jerikho khua ihsin an pawh zawng ah Timia ih fapa Bartimia an timi mitcaw kutdawh cu lamzin kiangah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nazareth mi Jesuh a si ti kha a theih tikah, “David Fapa Jesuh! I zaangfah hram aw,” tiah a au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Mi tampi in an kawk ih, “Daite in um aw,” tiah an ti. Asinain a dai duh cuang lo. “David Fapa, i zaangfah hram aw,” tiah ring sinsin in a au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesuh cu a cawl ih, “Hei ko hnik uh,” a ti. Mitcaw pa cu an ko ih, “Na lung awi aw, tho aw, a lo ko so khaw,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A puan sin laimi hlon duak in amah cu Jesuh hnenah a pet vurvo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Ziang lo tuah sak ding so na duh?” tiah Jesuh in a sut. Mitcaw pa in, “Sayapa, khua hmuh thei sal ka duh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Jesuh cun, “Va feh aw, na zumnak in a lo damter zo,” tiah a ti. Hmakhatteah khua a hmu thei ih cuih sin Jesuh cu a thlun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem khua an naih rero thlang ih Bethfath le Bethani khua kiang Olif tlang an thleng. Jesuh in a dungthluntu pahnih hmaiah a thlah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />an hnenah, “Nan hmaiih a ummi khawsungah va feh uh. Nan thlen tikah zohman ih to dah lomi laak note hreenmi nan hmu ding. A hri phoih uhla rak hruai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi pakhat in, ‘Ziangah so nan phoih?’ a lo ti le, ‘Bawipa in a hai, a lo khirh sal cing ding,’ va ti uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuticun an feh ih khawsung lamzinpi ah, inn pakhat sangka ah laak note pakhat hreenmi kha an hmu. A hri an phoih zawng ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />cutawkih a dingmi mi hrekkhat in, “Ziangah so laak note cu nan phoih rero,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Annih in Jesuh ih a sim cia vek cun an sim ih hmakhatte ah an fehter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesuh hnenah laak cu an rak hruai ih a parah an puan an dam hnuah Jesuh cu a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi tampi in a fehnak ding lamzin ah an puan an phah; mi hrek in sawl an khiak ih an phah ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hmaiih a fehmi in siseh, dunglamih a thluntu pawl in siseh: “Hosanna! Bawipa hmin in a rami cu Pathian in thlawsuah hram seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan pu David Siangpahrang uknak a ra dingmi cu Pathian in thlawsuah ko seh! Hosanna! A saangbik vanah khin Pathian cu thangṭhat si ko seh,” tiah an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesuh cu Jerusalem ah a lut ih Biakinn sungah a feh ih ziang hmuahhmuah kimtein a zoh thluh. Asinain tikcu a tlai zo ruangah a dungthluntu hleihnih thawn Bethani khua ah an va feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thaisun Bethani khua ihsin an rat sal laiah Jesuh cu a ril a rawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lamhlat nawnah a hnah niim ciaiciai in theikung pakhat a hmu ih a rah hawl dingah a pan. Sikhalsehla theikung kiang a thlen tikah a hnah lawng a hmu; ziangahtile theipi rah tikcu a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Zohman in na rah lo ei nawn hlah hai seh,” tiah theikung cu a ti. A dungthluntu pawl in cuih ṭong cu an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem an thlen tikah Jesuh cu Biakinn ah a feh ih thil a leitu le a zuartu pawl kha a dawihlo ṭheh. Paisa thlengtu pawl ih cabuai le laileng zuartu pawl ih tohkham pawl khal a lingleh sak thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Biakinn tualih thil phurih vak sukso pawl khal a kham ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipi pawl cu hiti in a sim: “Ca Thianghlim sungah Pathian in ‘Ka inn cu miphun hmuahhmuah hrangih thlacamnak inn ti a si ding,’ a timi a um. Sikhalsehla nannih in rukru relhnak lungpuk ah nan tuah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puithiam upa pawl le Daanthiam pawl in cuih thu an theih tikah Jesuh thah theinak lamzin an hawl. Annih in Jesuh cu an ṭih ngaingai, ziangahtile Jesuh thuzirhmi in misenpi pawl ih thinlung a ton tuk ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zanlam a si tikah Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu khawpi sung ihsin ah suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A thaizing zingpit lamzinih an feh laiah theikung cu an hei hmu. A zim ihsin a hram tiang a ro ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Piter in a vun mang sal ih Jesuh hnenah, “Zohhnik, Sayapa! Na cammi theikung kha a thi zo!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Pathian rinsan uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: zokhal sisehla a thinlung sungah rinhmainak nei loin a sim vekin a cang tengteng ding tiah a zumfek ahcun, ‘Hi tlang hi thawn awla tifinriat sungah va tla aw,’ a ti khalle tuah sak a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Curuangah hiti in ka lo sim: thla nan cam ih thil pakhatkhat nan dil tikah ka ngah zo tiin zum uhla nan dil mi hmuahhmuah cu nan ngah ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cun thlacam dingih nan din tikah mi pakhatkhat parih duh lonak nan neihmi kha va ngaithiam uh; cutikah vancungih a ummi nan Pa in nan sualnak kha a lo ngaithiam ve ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Jerusalem khua sungah an ra thleng sal. Jesuh cu Biakinn sungih a feh laiah puithiam upa, Daanthiam pawl le upa dang pawl an ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesuh cu, “Ziangvek thuneih theinak in so hi bangtuk thil hi na tuah? Zo in so hi thuneihnak hi a lo pek?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh in, “Thu pakhat ka lo sut dingih in let thei a si ahcun ziangvek thuneihnak in so hi bangtuk thil hi ka tuah, ti ka lo sim hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I simhnik uh: Johan ih baptisma a pek theinak thu hi zo ih hnen in so a ngah? Pathian hnen in maw, milai hnen in so?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Anmah le anmah an el aw ih, “Ziangtin so kan ti ding? ‘Pathian hnen ihsin,’ kan ti ahcun ‘Cuti asile ziangah so Johan cu nan zum lo?’ tiah in ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Asinain, ‘Milai hnen ihsin,’ kan ti ahcun misenpi ṭih a um fawn, ziangahtile misenpi in Johan cu profet a si ti kha an thei thluh fawn,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh hnenah, “Kan thei lo,” tiah an let. Jesuh in an hnenah, “Kei khal in ziangvek thuneihnak in so hi bangtuk thil hi ka tuah, ti ka lo sim ve lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh in an hnenah tahṭhimnak thawn thu a sim. “Hlanlaiah mi pakhat a um ih sabit hmuan a tuah; hawi a kulh, sabit sawrnak ah khur a lai ih rit kilnakah parthlam a sak. Cule thlawhhlawh a duhmi pawl hnenah a pekta ih amah cu khual a tlawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sabit rah lawh a cut tikah a covo la dingin a sal pakhat a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmuan thlotu pawl cun a salpa cu an kai ih an vuak ih kut lawngin an kirter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun sal dang pakhat a thlah sal. Hmuan thlotu pawl in a lu ah an vuak ih mualpho le ningzak in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmuan neitu pa cun sal dang a thlah lala, a sinan an rak that; sal dang tampi tla cuvek cun an tuah. Ṭhenkhat an vuak ih ṭhenkhat cu an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thlah dingih a taangmi cu a duhdawt zetmi fapa lawng a si thlang. Neta bikah hmuan thlotu pawl hnenah a fapa cu a thlah ih, “Ka fapa cu an upat ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain cuih hmuan thlotu pawl cun, “Hi pa hi hmuan neitu ih fapa a si. Ra uh kan that pei ih a thil hmuahhmuah kan ta a si ding,” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuti cun a fapa cu an kaih ih an thah hnuah a ruak cu hmuan lengah an hlon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Cuih hnuah hmuan neitu in ziangso a tuah ding?” tiah Jesuh in a sut hai. “Hmuan neitupa a ra ding ih a hlawhfa pawl cu a that ṭheh ding ih a hmuan cu hlawhfa dang kut ah a pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ca Thianghlim sungah: ‘Inn saktu pawl in santlai lo tiih an hnonmi lungto cu, A thupi bikmi lungto ah a cang riangri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cumi cu Bawipa ih tuahmi a si; Ziang tlukih zoh mawi so a si,’ tiih ngan ciami kha nan siar dah lo maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah mi upa pawl cun cuih tahṭhimnak cu anmah a ṭongsanmi a si, ti an theih ruangah Jesuh kha a kaih an tum. Asinain misenpi pawl an ṭih ruangah an suak ih Jesuh cu an fehsan sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Farasi mi hrekkhat le Herod minung pawl hrekkhat cu Jesuh kha thusuhnak in awk ngah dingah an thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesuh hnenah an ra thleng ih, “Sayapa, nang cu mi in ziangtin in ti pei ti khal ruat loin thudik na sim ti kan thei. Mi mithmai na zoh lo ih upa nauta thleidannak thinlung na nei lo. Pathian duhnak thudik lawng mi hnenah na sim. Curuangah fiangtein in sim hnik. Rom siangpahrang hnenah ngunkhuai pek hi kan Daan in a thlah maw thlah lo? Kan pe ding maw pe lo ding?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain an depdetnak kha Jesuh in a hmu ih, “Ziangah so thangih awh in tum? Ngun tangka rak keng hnik uh, ka zoh pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An rak keng ih Jesuh in, “Hihi zo ih hmuihmel le hmin so a si?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “Rom siangpahrang ih hmuihmel le hmin,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh in, “Cuti a si ahcun siangpahrang ta a si mi cu siangpahrang pek uhla Pathian ta a si mi cu Pathian hnenah pek uh,” tiah a ti. Cumi an theih tikah an mang a bang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Sadusi ṭhenkhat, thih hnuah cun zohman an thosal lo ding, tiah a zumtu pawl Jesuh hnenah an ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Sayapa, Moses in daan in ngan sakmi ah ‘Mipa pakhat a thih ih faate nei loin nupi a taan ahcun faate nei ih a can salnak dingah a thihsan mi a nupi cu a naupa in a ṭhi pei,’ tiah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Voikhat ah unau pasarih an um; upa bik pa cu nupi a ṭhi ih faate nei loin a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pahnihnak pa in cu nu cu a ṭhi ih faate nei loin a thi ve. Cuvek ṭhiamṭhiam in a pathumnak in cu nu cu a ṭhi naón a thihsan lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An zatein fa nei loin an thi ṭheh. An pasarih in cu nu cu an ṭhi ih faate nei loin an thi ṭheh a si. Neta bikah nunau nu khal a thi ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah thawhsal caan mithi an thawhsal ni ah cu nu cu zo ih nupi bik so a si ding? An pasarih in an ṭhi fingfing fawn,” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nan va palh lawmmam so? Ziangah kan palh ti nan thei maw? Ca Thianghlim siseh, Pathian cahnak huham siseh, nan theih lo ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ziangahtile mithi pawl an thawhsal tikah vancungih vanmi bangtuk an si ding ruangah ṭhit awk ti a um nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mithi thawhsalnak thu-ah cun Moses Cabu sungih hrambur a kangmi thu kha nan siar dah lo maw? Cutawkah Pathian in Moses hnenah, ‘Keimah cu Abraham ih Pathian, Isaak ih Pathian, le Jakob ih Pathian ka si,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian cu a nungmi pawl ih Pathian a si, a thi mi pawl ih Pathian a si lo. Curuangah nan palh nasa a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutawkah an thu relmi a thei vetu Daanthiam pakhat a rak um. Jesuh in Sadusi pawl ih thusuhnak kha a let thiam zet ti a theih tikah Jesuh hnenah a ra ih, “Khuimi thukham so a thupi bik?” tiah a ra sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesuh in, “A thupi bikmi thukham cu ‘Maw Israel mi pawl ngai uh! Bawipa kan Pathian lawng hi Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bawipa nan Pathian cu nan thinlung zate, nan nunnak zate, nan ruahnak zate le nan thazaang zate thawn nan duhdaw pei,’ tihi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cun a pahnihnak ih a thupimi thukham cu, ‘Na innhnen kha nangmah na duh awk vekin na duhdaw pei,’ tihi a si. Hi thukham pahnih hnakih a thupi sawnmi thukham a um nawn lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Daanthiam pa cun Jesuh hnenah, “Sayapa, na timi cu a ṭha ngaingai. Na sim bangtuk in Bawipa lawng hi Pathian a si ih pathian dang an um nawn lo, ti cu a dik ngaingaimi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cu ruangah milai in Pathian cu a thinlung zate, a ruahnak zate le a cahnak zate thawn a duhdaw pei ih amah ih pum a duhdawt vekin a innhnen cu a duhdaw ve pei. Hi thukham pahnih thlun cu mei-ur thawinak le thawinak dangdang pawl pek hnakin a thupi sawn a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in a thu lehmi cu a felzet a si ti kha a hmu ih a hnenah, “Nangmah cu Pathian Uknak thawn nan hlat aw lo,” tiah a ti. Cuih hnuah cun Jesuh cu zohman in thu an sut ngam nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Biakinn sungih thu a zirh laiah Jesuh in hiti in thu pakhat a sut, “Ziangtin so Daanthiam pawl in Messiah cu David tesinfa a si ding, tiah an ti thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amah David lala cu Thlarau Thianghlim in a simter ih, ‘Bawipa in ka Bawipa hnenah, Na ral pawl na ke hnuai ih ka ret ngah hlan lo, Ka vorhlam kapah to aw,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Amah David hman in Messiah cu ‘Bawipa,’ tiih a ko asile ziangtinso David ih tesinfa cu a si thei ding,” tiah a ti. Mi tampi in Jesuh thuzirhmi cu lungawi aipuang zetin an ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cutiih thu a zirh tikah Jesuh in, “Daanthiam pawl hi ṭhatein ralring uh. Annih cun an puanfualpi thawn tawihvah an duh ih mipi tamnak dawr tluan ah mi in upatnak thawn cibai in buk hai seh ti an duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Sinakok ah tonak ṭha bik an ham cia ih puai tuahnak hmun ah hmun ṭha bik an hril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nuhmei pawl kha a miat hawlnak ah an hmang ih an inn tiangin an lawng. Cule mi in in hmu hai seh tiah rei zetzet in thla an cam. Hrem an ton dingmi cu midang tonmi hnakin a nasa sawn ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesuh cu Biakinn tangka retnak kiangah a to ih mi in thawhlawm tangka an pek lai rero kha a zoh. Milian tampi in tangka tampi an san.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cule a farah zetmi nuhmei pakhat a ra ih daar tangka pia hnih a san ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A dungthluntu pawl kha hmunkhat ah a ko ih an hnenah, “Fiangtein ka lo sim: hi farah nuhmei nu in thawhlawm sannak kuang sungah midang hmuahhmuah hnakin tam bik a san a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ziangahtile midang pawl cun an neihmi sungin a hleifuan an pek; asinain hi nuhmei nu cun a farah zet naón a neihmi hmuahhmuah a san; a pumcawmnak ih a hman dingmi hmuahhmuah a pek ṭheh a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh cu Biakinn ihsin a feh zawng ah a dungthluntu pakhat in, “Sayapa, zohhnik! Hi inn le lungpipi pawl cu an va mak so!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Hi a nasa zetmi inn pawl hi na hmu a si lo maw? Hi lungpipi pawl hi pakhat hman an umnak keel ah an um nawn lo tikcu a thleng ding, an zatein an cim ṭheh ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh cu Olif Tlang, Biakinn ihsin ralden ih a ummi Tlangah cun a to; cutawkah Piter, Jeim, Johan le Andru a thuptein an ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hi bangtuk caan cu ziangtikah so a si ding? In sim hnik! Cuih caan a ra thleng cing ding ti theihthiamnak ah ziang hminsinnak so a um ding?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Ralring uh! Zohman in lo bum hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi tampi keimah ih hmih in an ra ding ih ‘Amah ka si,’ tiah an ti ding ih mi tampi an bum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lam naite ih raldonak thawm le lam hlapi ih raldonak thawmvang pawl nan theih tikah thinphang in um hlah uh. Cubangtuk thil cu a thleng ding, asinain caan netnak a si hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ram khat le ram khat, uknak pakhat le pakhat, an do aw ding. Khawzakip ah ling a hnin ding ih paam a tlung ding. Cubangtuk cu nauhrin zikih pumnat thok vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nanmah hrimhrim nan ralring pei. An lo kai ding ih khonsil zung tampi ah an lo suahpi hai ding; Sinakok tla ah an lo thawi ding; keimah ruangah hotu le siangpahrang hmaiah an lo dingter ding. Cuih caan cu ka Thuthang ṭha nan simnak ding caan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla caan a net hlanah Thuthang ṭha cu miphun hmuahhmuah hnenah sim a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule an lo kai ih zungih an lo suahpi tikah ziangso kan sim ding tiah a hlankhan in va phang hlah uh. Tikcu a ra thlen tikah nan sim dingmi cu theihter nan si ding. Ziangahtile nan simmi ṭong cu nanmah ih ṭong a si lo ding; Thlarau Thianghlim ih simmi ṭong a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unau le unau kha thihnak tiangin an phiar aw ding; cuvek ṭhiamṭhiam in pale in an faale parah an tuah ding. Faale in an nu le an pa pawl an dodal ding ih thihnak tiang an thlenter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in keimah ruangah an lo hua ding. Sikhalsehla a netnak tiang a tuarsuak theitu cu rundam an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuksumza Thil-borhhlawh cu a din lonak ding hmunih a din kha nan hmu ding.” (Hi ca a siartu: a sim duhmi hi theithiam aw.) “Cule Judea pengih a ummi pawl an zatein tlang parah tlan hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A inn tlun diphun ih a ummi in a ken dingmi thil lak dingah inn sungah vung lut hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lo ih a ummi in a puan lak dingah a inn ah tlung hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Favun le nau-awkkai neimi hrangah cun a har ngaingai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih harsatnak pawl cu thlatang lai ngelcel ih a thlen lonak dingah Pathian hnenah thlacam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ziangahtile hi thil a thleng dingmi hi Pathian ih leilung a seemsuah thokin atu tiangah a um dah keel lomi harsatnak a si ding. Hmailam ziangtik khalah a um dah nawn fawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa in cuih ni cu a malter zo; malter loin um sehla zovek milai hman an taang lo ding. Asinain a hril ciami pawl hrangah cuih ni khua cu a tawiter zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mi pakhatkhat in ‘Zohhnik uh, hinah Messiah a um,’ ‘Zohhnik uh, khinah Messiah a um,’ tiah an lo ti khalle va zum hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ziangahtile Messiah deu le profet deu tampi an ra ding. Pathian hril ciami pawl hman an bum thei tawk bum dingah hmuhsaknak mak le khawruahhar tampi tla an tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ralring uh! A hlankhan in ziang hmuahhmuah ka lo sim cia zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Cuih harsatnak caan hnuah cun ni a thim ding ih thlapi tla a vang lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Van ihsin arsi pawl an tla ding ih van tlolak ih a ummi pawl ih cahnak le huham pawl cu an lamzin keel ihsin an pial ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule Milai Fapa cu a lang ding ih cahnak le sunlawinak thawn mero lakin a rung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Leilung khatlam deng ihsin khatlam deng tiangih a ummi Pathian ih hril ciami pawl khawm dingah leilung kil li ah vancungmi pawl a thlah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Theikung ihsin ralrinnak zir uh. A hnge pawl an hring ih a ziik tla a mum ih hnah note an cerh tikah ṭhal tikcu a nai thlang ti nan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuvekin hi bangtuk thil a thlen vivo tikah tikcu a nai zo, a ra thleng zik thlang, ti kha nan thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hitawkih a ummi pawl an thih ṭheh hlanah hi thil hmuahhmuah a thleng ṭheh ding, ti hi hngilh hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Van le leilung hi a cemral ding naón ka ṭongkam hi cu an cemral dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla ziangtikah cuih ni le caan a ra thleng ding, ti cu zohman in an thei lo; vanih vancungmi in an thei lo, Fapa khal in a thei lo, Pa lawng in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ziangtikah a tikcu a thleng ding ti nan theih lo ruangah ralringte le fimkhur tein um uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ziang thawn a bangrep tile mi pakhat khual tlawng dingin a pok ih a hnen-um pawl kha an ṭuanvo felte le kimtein a pekta ih sangka kiltu pa tla it lo siing loih sangka kil dingah a tiamtatu inn neitupa bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Inn neitu bawi cu ziang tikah a ra thleng ding, ti nan theih lo ruangah ralring zetin um uh. Zanlam ah a si thei, zanṭim ah a si thei, khawvang hlan khalah a si thei ih nisuak zawng khalah a si thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Rinlopi ih a ra thlen a si ahcun na ihthat lai lo tong pang hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nan hnenih ka simmi hi mi hmuahhmuah hnen khalah ka sim a si: Ralring in um uh,” tiah Jesuh in a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lantak puai le Thilnu telh lo sang puai a kimnak dingah ni hnih lawng a duh. Puithiam upa pawl le Daanthiam pawl in Jesuh kha a thupte in kai ih thah theinak lamzin an hawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asinain, “Puai tikcu lai ahcun kan tuah lo pei, misenpi pawl in hnaihnawhnak an suahter pang ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh cu Bethani khua, phaarnat a rak tuartu Simon inn ah a um ih rawl a ei laiah nunau nu in alabaster thawl pakhat in a mankhung zetmi rimhmui a khatin a rak keng. Cuih thawl cu a khuai ih rimhmui cu Jesuh lu ah a toih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutawkih a ummi mi ṭhenkhat pawl cu an thin a heng ih, “A va pamhmai ve!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rimhmui cu ngun tangka zathum hnakih tam ah zuar in cuih tangka cun mifarah bawm sehla a ṭha sawn lo maw?” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti aw ih cu nu cu an mawhthluk ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh in, “Zianghman ti hlah uh! Ziangah so nan buaipi rero? Hi nu hin thil ṭha le thil mawi a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mifarah cu kumkhua nan hnenah an um ding ih nan duh ahcun ziangtik khalah nan bawm thei. Asinain kei cu nan hnenah ka um ringring lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tuah thei tawk a tuah zo. Ka taksa pum parah rimhmui a toihmi hi keimah vuinak dingah a hlankhan in a timtuah ciami a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: leilung pumpuluk Thuthang ṭha an simnak kipah hi a tuahmi hi amah theihnak ah an sim ringring ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule dungthluntu hleihnih lakih pakhat Judas Iskariot cu Jesuh zuar dingah puithiam upa pawl hnenah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An hnenih a ṭongmi pawl an theih tikah an lung a awi ngaingai ih tangka pe dingin thu an rak kam. Cule Judas cun Jesuh a zuar ngah ih an kut sung a thlenter theinak dingah caan ṭha a bawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thilnu rawi lo Sang Puai ni khatnak ni, Lantak Puai rawldonak hrangih tuu faate pawl an thah ni ah dungthluntu pawl in, “Khuiah so Lantak Puai zanriah kan lo timtuah sak ding na duh?” tiah Jesuh kha an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in mi pahnih a thlah ih hiti in thu a cah, “Khawsung ah va feh uhla tithawl in tidai a phurtu pa thawn nan tong aw ding. Amah cu thlun uhla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a luhnak innih inn neitupa hnenah ‘Sayapa in amah le a dungthluntu pawl Lantak Puai zanriah an hil tlaangnak ding inn khaan khuiso a si? tiah va sut uh, in ti,’ va ti uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule anih in tlunta khaan tumpi a lo hmuh ding. Ziang hmuahhmuah ṭhate le kimteih timtuah ciami khaan a si ding ih cunah cun zanriah ei tlaangnak ding cu va tuah uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl cu an pok ih khawsung an thlen tikah Jesuh ih sim ciami bangtuk in ziang hmuahhmuah an hmu. Cunah Lantak Puai zanriah cu an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zanlam a si tikah Jesuh cu a dungthluntu hleihnih thawn an ra thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cabuai ih rawl an ei laiah Jesuh cun, “Fiangtein ka lo sim: Nanmah lakah pakhat, keimah thawn rawl a ei tlangtu pa in i zuar ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl cu an thin a nuam lo ngaingai ih pakhat hnu pakhat in, “Na tisanmi hi kei ka si lo, ti aw?” tiah an ti fingfing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nanmah hleihnih lakah a telmi, keimah thawn kheng khat sungih sang a hnimtu pa a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Milai Fapa cu thihnak a tuar ding, tiah Ca Thianghlim ih a ti vekin a thi ko ding. Asinain hi Milai Fapa a zuartu hrangah cun a hmakhua a pit a si! Suak lo lawlaw in rak um sehla amah ih hrangah cun a ṭha sawn ding naón!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zanriah an ei laiah Jesuh in sang a lak ih thla a cam hnuah sang cu a phel ih a dungthluntu pawl hnenah a pek. “Hi hi ka taksa a si; Lak uhla ei uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuih hnuah hai a lak ih Pathian hnenah lungawinak thla a cam hnuah an hnenah a pek ih an zatein an in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Himi hi mi tampi hrangih ka thletmi ka thisen a si; Pathian thukamnak a nemhngettu ka thisen a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: Pathian Uknak sungih sabit thar ka in hlanlo hi sabit cu ka in sal nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule hla an sak hnuah an suak ih Olif Tlangah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Nan zatein in taan ding ih nan tlanhlo ṭheh ding; ziangahtile Ca Thianghlim sungah ‘Pathian in tuukhal cu a that ding ih tuu pawl cu ṭhekdarh an si ṭheh ding,’ tiah ngan cia in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sikhalsehla thihnak ihsin thawhtersal ka si hnuah cun nan hmaiah Galilee ah ka feh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Piter in, “Midang in lo tlansan ṭheh hman hai sehla kei cun ka lo tlansan hrimhrim lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesuh in Piter cu, “Fiangtein ka lo sim: tuihzan ar voi hnih a khuan hlanah voi thum tiang ‘Ka thei lo a si,’ tiah i phatsan ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Piter cun nasa sinsin in, “Na hnenih thi ding ka si ve hmanah cu vek cun ka ṭong hrimhrim lo ding,” tiah a ti. Dungthluntu dang khal in cuvek ṭhiamṭhiam in an ti ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gethsemane timi hmun an thleng ih Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl hnenah, “Ka thlacam sung hinah rak um uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Piter, Jeim le Johan kha a hruai. Thinhar le awloksong in a um ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />an hnenah cun, “Ka thinlung hi riahsiatnak in a khat tuk ih a kuai ṭheh ding a bang. Hinah rak um uhla it loin i rak hngak uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hmaiah malte a va feh ih leilung ah a bok ih thla a cam. A can thei ahcun cuih harsatnak cu tong lo dingin a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Abba, Ka pa! Na hrangah cun ziang hmuahhmuah a cang thei ṭheh. Hi tuarnak khuathai hi ka hnen ihsin la hram aw. Asinain ka duh vekin si hlah seh, na duh vekin si sawnseh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cun a ra kir ih dungthluntu pathum an ihthat kha a hmu. Piter hnenah, “Simon, na rak itthat maw si? Nazi pakhat sung hman itthat loin i hngak thei hrimhrim lo maw si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cule an hnenah, “Itthat loin hngak uhla sualforhnak sungih tla lo dingin thlacam uh. Thinlung cun a duh naón taksa cu a thazaang a mal a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesuh cu a feh sal ih a hmaisa vekin thla a cam lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cun a ra kir ih dungthluntu pawl an itthat ṭheh kha a hmu; an mit an meng thei hrimhrim lo. Ziangtiih rak son ding ti khal an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A voithumnak a ra kir sal tikah an hnenah cun, “Nan itthat hrih maw si? Nan cawl thei hrih lai maw si? Tawk seh! A tikcu a thleng zo! Zoh uh! Milai Fapa cu misual pawl kut sungah pek a si ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tho uhla feh uhsi! Zoh uh, i zuartu pa a ra thleng!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jesuh cu a ṭong rero laiah dungthluntu hleihnih lakih a tel vemi Judas cu a ra thleng. Judas thawn hmun khatah, puithiam upa pawl, Daanthiam pawl le Judah mi upa pawl ih thlahmi miburpi cu ralnam le talhtum pawl kengin an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mizuartu pa cun mipi pawl cu hminsinnak a rak pek cia zo ih, “Ka hnam mipa cu kaih nan duhmi pa a si ding. Amah cu kai uhla ṭhatein kil uhla fehpi uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Judas cun a ra thlen vete in Jesuh cu a pan ih, “Sayapa!” tiah a ti ih a hnam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Cutiin Jesuh cu an kai ih fektein an khit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Culai ah an kiangih a dingmi pakhat in a ralnam a zuk ih Puithiam sang hnen-um pa ih hna a sah thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cun, “Keimah hi rukru maw ka si, ralnam le talhtum thawn nan rat ciamco?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nitinte Biakinn ah thu ka lo zirh ṭheu laiah zohman in in kai fawn lo. Asi, Ca Thianghlim sung thu cu a kim a ṭul a si,” tiah a ti hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Cule a dungthluntu hmuahhmuah in an tlansan ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Mino pakhat, puan paate lawng a sinmi pa in Jesuh cu a thlun. Amah khal cu a kaih an tum ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />asinain a puan taan in a tak lawngin a tlanhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Jesuh cu Puithiam sang inn ah an hruai ih cutawkah puithiam upa pawl, upa dang pawl le Daanthiam pawl an tong aw khawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />A hlat nawn ihsin Piter in a thlun ih Puithiam Saang ih tual ah a lut. Tual ah ralvengtu pawl hnenah a to ih meisa a ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Puithiam upa pawl le thuṭhentu Khonsil upa pawl in Jesuh cu thah duh ah a sual an hawl rero naón an hmu thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Mi tampi in thuphan per in Jesuh cu sual an puh, asinain an thu a rual aw thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Cun mi ṭhenkhat, a dik lo thutheitu si in an ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />“Hi pa hin ‘Milai sakmi hi Biakinn hi ka bal ṭheh ding ih ni thum sungah milai ih tuah lomi Biakinn ka sak ding,’ a ti, kan thei,” tiah Jesuh cu thuphan an puh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Sikhalsehla annih khal cu an thu a rual aw thei cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />An zate hmaiah Puithiam Saang cu a ding ih Jesuh cu thu a sut. “Sual an lo puh hi na let thei lo maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh cu daitein a um ih ṭong kam khat hman a let lo. Cule Puithiam Saang cun, “Sunloih mi Pathian ih Fapa Messiah cu na si maw?” tiah a sut sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ka si! Milai Fapa hi Ziangkimtithei ih vorhlam kapah to in vancung mero thawn a rat khal nan hmu leh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Cutikah Puithiam Saang cun a puan a thlek ih, “Thutheitu dang kan ṭul nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Pathian a nautat zia cu nan thei thluh zo! Ziangtin nan ruat?” tiah a ti. An zatein Jesuh cu misual a si ih thah tlak a si, tiah an lung a kim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Mi hrek in Jesuh cu cil an phui; a mit an huh ih an thawi. “A lo thawitu hi zoso a si, simhnik!” tiah an ti. Cule ralkap pawl in an fehpi ih an beng phahphah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Piter cu Puithiam Saang ih tualih a um laiah Puithiam Saang ih hnen-um nu pakhat a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Piter cu meisa a ai kha a hmuh tikah hmaitontein a zoh ih, “Nangmah khal hi Nazareth mi Jesuh thawn a rak um tlangmi na si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Asinain Piter cun a phatsan ih, “Ka thei lo. Na ṭongmi hi ziangthu a si ti ka thei lo,” tiah a ti. Cule kotka zin lamah a ṭhawn. Cuvete in ar a khuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Hnen-um nu cun a va hmu lala ih a kiangkap mi pawl hnenah, “Hi pa khal hi an lakah a tel sokhaw!” tiah a sim lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Asinain Piter cun a phat thotho. Reilote ah a kiangkap ih a dingmi pawl in Piter cu, “Nangmah khal an lakih tel na si hrimhrim ko, ziangahtile Galilee mi na sisi!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Cun Piter in, siatcam in thu a kam ih, “Nan timi pa hi zo a si ti ka thei hrimhrim lo,” tiah thlalet cam in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Cuvete in a voihnihnak ar a khuang ih Piter cun Jesuh in, “Ar voi hnih a khuan hlanah voi thum tiang ‘Ka thei lo a si,’ tiah i phatsan ding,” a rak timi kha a vun mang sal ih napi in a ṭap.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zingpitte ah Puithiam upa pawl cu upa dang pawl le Daanthiam pawl le thuṭhentu Khonsil upa pawl thawn zamrangin an tong ih thu an ruat khawm. Jesuh cu thir cikcin thawn khit in an hruai ih Pilat kut ah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pilat in, “Judah siangpahrang na si maw?” tiah a rak sut. Jesuh in, “Nangmah in na ti si!” tiah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puithiam upa pawl in Jesuh cu sual a phunphun an puh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Pilat in, “An thu hi na let lo ding maw? Sual an lo puhnak hmuahhmuah hi ngaihnik,” tiah a ti lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesuh cu a ṭong duh thotho lo ih Pilat cu a mang a bang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lantak Puai poh ah kum tinte Pilat in thawngtla mi lakin mipi ih dilmi kha a thlah ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Culai ah Barabbas an timi, ralthawh laiah mi a rak thattu pa cu ral a thotu dang pawl thawn thawng ah an thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Misenpi pawl cu an ra suak ih kumtin an tuah ṭheu vekin thawngtla suah ding cu Pilat hnenah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pilat in, “Judah Siangpahrang hi lo thlah sak ningla nan duh maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pilat in a hnenah Jesuh an peknak cu Puithiam upa pawl in Jesuh an nahsiik ruangah a si ti cu a thei keukeu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain Pilat in Barabbas sawn thlahter dingah puithiam upa pawl in misenpi cu an rak forhcia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pilat in a sut lala ih, “Cuti asile Judah siangpahrang nan timi pa hi ziangti in tuah so nan duh?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Annih in, “Thinglamtah parah that aw!” tiah an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ziang sualnak so a tuah?” tiah Pilat cun a sut lala. Annih in, “Thinglamtah parah that ko aw!” tiah na sinsin in an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pilat in misenpi lungkimnak tuah a duh ruangah an hrangah Barabbas a thlah. Cule Jesuh cu a thawiter ih thinglamtah parih that dingin an kut ah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ralkap pawl in Jesuh cu Mangki bawipa ih tual ah an luhpi ih mipi dang pawl tla an ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh cu puan sen an sinter; hling in lukhuh an tuah ih a lu ah an khumter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule salaam an pek ih, “Judah Siangpahrang, a nunkhua sau hram seh!” tiah an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A lu ah fungfek in an thawi, cil an phui, an ṭhilhṭhuam ih a hmai ah atu le atu an lu an kuun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutiih an hmuhsuam ṭheh hnuah puansen an sintermi kha an hlit ih amah ih hnipuan an hrukter sal. Cule thinglamtah parih khenbet dingah an hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lamzin ah Simon an timi pa an tong. Amah cu khawte ihsin khawpi ah a rami a si ih ralkap pawl in Jesuh thinglamtah kha hranhram in an putter. Simon cu Sairin khua mi a si ih Alexander le Rufus ih pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesuh cu Golgotha timi hmun ah an thlenpi. Golgotha ti cu “Luruh hmun,” tican a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutawkah sabitti, mura an timi sii thawn an rawimi kha an pek, asinain Jesuh cun a in duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuih hnuah thinglamtah ah an khen ih camcawhfung zuukin a hnipuan an zem aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutiih an khen cu zinglam nazi pakua a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A sual an puhnak cataar cu, “Judah Siangpahrang,” ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amah thawn hmun khatah fifir pahnih, a vorhlam ah pakhat, a kehlam ah pakhat an that ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A vak suksotu pawl tla in cimseh tiah an diriam in an lu an sut ih an hmuhsuam. “Nangmah cu Biakinn bal tahratin ni thum sungah sak sal a tumtu pa kha na si lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Atu thinglamtah par in rung ṭum awla nangmah le nangmah run aw hnik!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cuvek thothoin Puithiam upa pawl le Daanthiam pawl in Jesuh cu an hnihsan ih, “Midang a runsuak naón amah cu a runsuak aw thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel Siangpahrang, Messiah cu thinglamtah par ihsin atu rori ah a rung ṭum kha hmu uhsila cu kan zum ko ding,” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti aw. Cule amah thawn thinglamtah parih khenbet mi pahnih tla in an hmuhsuam ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sun laifangah cuih ram pumpuluk ah nazi pathum sung thimkhawzing a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zanlam nazi pathum ah Jesuh cu, “Eloi, Eloi, lema sabakthani!” tiah napi in a au. A tican cu, “Ka Pathian, ka Pathian, ziangah so i tlansan?” tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cutawkih a ummi ṭhenkhat in an thei ih, “Ngaihnik uh, Elijah a ko a si hi!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi pakhat a va tlan vurvo ih puansia kha sabitti thur sungah a va ciah ih fung parah a ṭemcih hnuah Jesuh ih kaa ah a hun hnih; “Hngak hrihhnik uh! Thinglamtah par ihsin ṭhum dingah Elijah a rung maw rung lo kan zoh pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesuh cu napi in a au ih a hnuk a cat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cuvete in Biakinn puanzar cu a tlunlam ihsin a hnuailam tiang ṭhen hnih ah a tlek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Thinglamtah hmai zawnih a dingtu ralbawipa in Jesuh a thih kha a hmuh tikah, “Hi pa hi Pathian Fapa ngaingai a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cutawkih nunau hrekkhat pawl cun lamhlat nawn in an cuan. Anmah tla cu Mari Magdalene, Jeim nauta sawn le Josef ih nu Mari, le Salome an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesuh kha Galilee ram a um laiah a rak thluntu pawl le a rak bawmtu pawl an si. Jesuh thawn Jerusalem ah a ra thlengmi nunau dang tampi tla an um ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Zanlam a si thlang; sabbath ni thlen hlan Timtuah Ni a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cule Arimathea khuami Josef a ra thleng. Amah cu thuṭhentu Khonsil upa pawl lakah upat zetmi sungtel a si ih Pathian Uknak a ra thlen ding kha a hngakhlap zettu a si. Josef cu ralṭha zetin Pilat hnenah a lut ih Jesuh ruak kha a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Pilat in Jesuh a thi zo, ti a theih tikah a mang a bang ngaingai. Ralbawipa a ko ih, “Jesuh a thihnak a rei zo maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jesuh a thi thla zo ti kha ralbawipa hnen ihsin a theih tikah Pilat in Jesuh ih ruang cu Josef a lakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Josef in puan nemte a lei ih Jesuh ruak cu thinglamtah par ihsin a ṭhum ih puan in a tuam hnuah lungkhermi thlaan ah a phum. Cule lungphengpi in thlaan ka cu a kharta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mari Magdalene le Josef nu Mari tla in a kiangin an zoh ve ih Jesuh ruak a retnak cu an hmu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabbath ni a cem hnuah Mari Magdalene, Jeim nu Mari le Salome in Jesuh ruak va culh dingah zihmui an lei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nipi zing, nisuak zawng ah thlaan ah an va feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lamzin an feh phah ah, “Thlankhar lungphengpi teh zo in so in ṭhawn sak ding?” tiah pakhat le pakhat an sut aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih lung cu lungpheng hlaipi a si. Cule an hun zoh tikah lungphengpi cu a rak ṭhawn aw zo kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlan sungah an vung lut ih tlangval pakhat puan rang sin in vorhlam kapih a to kha an hmu ih an phang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anih in, “Nan thin phang hlah uh! Thinglamtah ih an thahmi Nazareth Jesuh nan hawl ti ka thei. Hinah a um nawn lo, a thosal zo. An retnak hmun hi ra zoh hman uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Va feh uhla a dungthluntu pawl le Piter kha ‘Nan hmaiah Galilee ah a feh ding. Cutawkah a lo sim cia vekin nan hmu ding,’ tiah va sim uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutiin an suak ih thlaan ihsi cun thinphang le tuksum in an tlan. An ṭih tuk ruangah zo hnen hmanah ziang hman an sim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nipi ni ah thihnak ihsin Jesuh a thawh hnuah a hmaisa bik ah Mari Magdalene hnenah a lang; Mari Magdalene cu a sung ihsin khuavang pasarih a dawisuahmi nunau kha a si. Nunau pawl cu Piter le a rualpi pawl hnenah an feh ih an theihmi thuhla cu a tawinak in an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mari Magdalene cu a feh ih a rualpi pawl a va sim. Cupawl cu Jesuh a thih ruangah mithi ngai in an ṭap rero. Cuih hnuah Jesuh amah rori in kumkhua rundamnak thu, thu nung le thu thianghlim cu nisuahnak ihsin nitlaknak tiang a dungthluntu pawl hmangin a than a si.]
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Jesuh a nungsal zo, ka hmu a si!” tiah a sim tikah an zum lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh cu dungthluntu pahnih khawte lamih an feh laiah phun dangin an hnenah a lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An kir ih midang pawl tla an sim, asinain annih khal in an zum lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Neta bikah Jesuh cu dungthluntu hleikhat rawl an ei laiah an hnenah a lang. Zumnak an neih lo ruangah le amah a nungin a hmutu pawl an zum lo ih thinlung ruh an neih ruangah a kawk hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule an hnenah, “Leilung khuazakip ah va feh uhla mi hmuahhmuah hnenah Thuthang ṭha va sim uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zokhal sisehla a zum ih baptisma a co ahcun rundam a si ding. Asinain a zum lotu cu hnon a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A zumtu pawl cu mangbangza tuah theinak huham pek an si ding; ka hmin in ramhuai an dawi thei ding; ṭong thar in an ṭong ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />rul an kaih ah siseh, thihsii an in hmanah siseh, an zianghman a poi lo ding; mina parah an kut an suang ding ih mina cu an dam ding,” tiah a ti. [
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa Jesuh cu an hnenih thu a sim ṭheh hnuah vancungah laakso in a um ih Pathian vorhlam kapah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule dungthluntu pawl cu an feh ih khuazakip ah thu an sim; Bawipa cu an hnenah hna a ṭuan ih mangbangza an tuahmi in an thusim mi a dik a si, ti kha a langter.] [
  </para>
</usx>
